// Business Builder steps, export requirements and other guidance seeded in the database (V2-V5 migrations).
// If an administrator edits a step, the edited text shows in English until a translation is added here.
// English text -> [Afrikaans, Sepedi, Xitsonga, isiZulu]. DRAFT: review with first-language speakers.
export default {
  "A budget shows whether each crop covers its costs before you plant.": ["'n Begroting wys of elke gewas sy koste dek voordat jy plant.", "Tekanyetšo e bontšha ge e ba sebjalo se sengwe le se sengwe se khupetša ditshenyegelo tša sona pele o bjala.", "Bajete yi komba loko ximila xin'wana na xin'wana xi funengeta swihlawulo swa xona u nga si byala.", "Isabelomali sikhombisa ukuthi isitshalo ngasinye siyazimboza yini izindleko zaso ngaphambi kokutshala."],
  "A complete application is processed faster.": ["'n Volledige aansoek word vinniger verwerk.", "Kgopelo ye e feletšego e šongwa ka pela.", "Xikombelo lexi heleleke xi lulamisiwa hi xihatla.", "Isicelo esiphelele sicutshungulwa ngokushesha."],
  "A registered brand proves ownership and helps recover stolen animals.": ["'n Geregistreerde brandmerk bewys eienaarskap en help om gesteelde diere terug te kry.", "Leswao le le ngwadišitšwego le hlatsela bong gomme le thuša go hwetša diphoofolo tše di utswitšwego.", "Mfungho lowu tsarisiweke wu kombisa vun'wini naswona wu pfuna ku kuma swiharhi leswi yiviweke.", "Uphawu olubhalisiwe lufakazela ubunikazi futhi lusiza ukubuyisa izilwane ezintshontshiwe."],
  "A registered co-operative can buy inputs and sell produce in bulk and apply for co-operative support schemes.": ["'n Geregistreerde koöperasie kan insette en produkte in grootmaat koop en verkoop en vir koöperatiewe ondersteuningskemas aansoek doen.", "Kopanelo ye e ngwadišitšwego e ka reka ditlabakelo le go rekiša dijo ka bontši gomme ya kgopela merero ya thekgo ya dikopanelo.", "Ntirhisano lowu tsarisiweke wu nga xava swipfuno na ku xavisa swibyariwa hi xitalo naswona wu kombela swikimi swa nseketelo swa mintirhisano.", "Ubambiswano olubhalisiwe lungathenga izinto zokulima futhi luthengise umkhiqizo ngobuningi futhi lufake izicelo zezinhlelo zokweseka ubambiswano."],
  "A reserved name is needed before a company or co-operative can be registered.": ["'n Bespreekte naam is nodig voordat 'n maatskappy of koöperasie geregistreer kan word.", "Leina le le beeleditšwego le a nyakega pele khamphani goba kopanelo e ka ngwadišwa.", "Vito leri hlayiseriweke ra laveka ku nga si tsarisiwa khamphani kumbe ntirhisano.", "Igama elibekisiwe liyadingeka ngaphambi kokuba inkampani noma ubambiswano lubhaliswe."],
  "A wrong choice can cost you tax or block a grant application.": ["'n Verkeerde keuse kan jou belasting kos of 'n toelaagaansoek blokkeer.", "Kgetho ye e fošagetšego e ka go lefiša motšhelo goba ya thibela kgopelo ya thušo.", "Nhlawulo wo hoxeka wu nga ku durhela xibalo kumbe wu sivela xikombelo xa mpfuno.", "Ukukhetha okungalungile kungakubiza intela noma kuvimbe isicelo soxhaso."],
  "Accountant": ["Rekenmeester", "Molaodi wa ditšhelete", "Mukamberi wa timali", "Umgcini-mabhuku"],
  "Add a crop plan for each crop (hectares, expected yield and price). The planning tab pre-fills prices from the marketplace and costs from your statements.": ["Voeg 'n gewasplan vir elke gewas by (hektaar, verwagte oes en prys). Die beplanningsoortjie vul pryse vooraf in vanaf die mark en koste vanaf jou state.", "Oketša leano la sebjalo bakeng sa sebjalo se sengwe le se sengwe (dihektara, puno ye e letetšwego le theko). Thepo ya peakanyo e tlatša ditheko go tšwa mmarakeng le ditshenyegelo go tšwa ditatementeng tša gago.", "Engetela pulani ya ximila eka ximila xin'wana na xin'wana (tihekitara, ntshovelo lowu languteriweke na nxavo). Xiphemu xo pulana xi tata minxavo ku suka emakete na swihlawulo ku suka eka swiviko swa wena.", "Engeza uhlelo lwesitshalo esitshalweni ngasinye (amahektha, isivuno esilindelekile nentengo). Ithebhu yokuhlela igcwalisa amanani asuka emakethe nezindleko ezivela ezitatimendeni zakho."],
  "Africa": ["Afrika", "Afrika", "Afrika", "IAfrika"],
  "Agree on a constitution with at least five members and register the co-operative with CIPC.": ["Kom ooreen oor 'n grondwet met ten minste vyf lede en registreer die koöperasie by CIPC.", "Dumelelanang ka molaotheo le maloko a bonyane a mahlano gomme le ngwadiše kopanelo go CIPC.", "Pfumelelanani hi vumbiwa na swirho swa ntlhanu hi xitsongo kutani mi tsarisa ntirhisano eka CIPC.", "Vumelanani ngomthethosisekelo namalungu okungenani amahlanu bese nibhalisa ubambiswano ku-CIPC."],
  "Agree the temperature regime for the voyage (including any cold treatment the protocol requires) and use PPECB-approved cold stores and containers.": ["Kom die temperatuurregime vir die reis ooreen (insluitend enige kouebehandeling wat die protokol vereis) en gebruik PPECB-goedgekeurde koelkamers en houers.", "Dumelelanang ka thempereitšha ya leeto (go akaretšwa kalafo ya go tonya ye tshepedišo e e nyakago) gomme le šomiše dipolokelo tše di tonyago le ditshelo tše di dumeletšwego ke PPECB.", "Pfumelelanani hi thempureche ya riendzo (ku katsa ku tshungula hi xirhami loku nawu wu ku lavaka) kutani mi tirhisa vuhlayiselo bya xirhami na tikhonteyina leti pfumeleriweke hi PPECB.", "Vumelanani ngezinga lokushisa lohambo (kuhlanganise nanoma ukwelashwa ngokubanda okudingwa ngumgomo) futhi nisebenzise iziqandisi neziqukathi ezigunyazwe yi-PPECB."],
  "Animal identification": ["Diere-identifikasie", "Boitsebišo bja diphoofolo", "Vutivikani bya swiharhi", "Ukuhlonza izilwane"],
  "Apply for customs client registration as an exporter through SARS eFiling (Registration, Licensing and Accreditation). Your clearing agent will use your customs code on export declarations.": ["Doen aansoek om doeanekliëntregistrasie as 'n uitvoerder deur SARS eFiling (Registrasie, Lisensiëring en Akkreditasie). Jou klaringsagent sal jou doeanekode op uitvoerverklarings gebruik.", "Kgopela ngwadišo ya modirelwa wa customs bjalo ka moromela ntle ka SARS eFiling (Registration, Licensing and Accreditation). Moemedi wa gago wa go phatlalatša o tla šomiša khoutu ya gago ya customs dipegong tša go romela ntle.", "Kombela ku tsarisiwa tanihi khastomara ya customs tanihi muxavisi wa le handle hi SARS eFiling (Registration, Licensing and Accreditation). Muyimeri wa wena wo basisa u ta tirhisa khodi ya wena ya customs eka swiviko swa ku xavisa ehandle.", "Faka isicelo sokubhaliswa njengekhasimende lamakhastomu njengomthekelisi nge-SARS eFiling (Registration, Licensing and Accreditation). Umenzeli wakho wokukhipha uzosebenzisa ikhodi yakho yamakhastomu ezimemezelweni zokuthekelisa."],
  "Appoint a freight forwarder and book space": ["Stel 'n vragverskeper aan en bespreek ruimte", "Thwala moromi wa dithoto gomme o beeletše sebaka", "Thola murhumeri wa nhundzu kutani u buka ndhawu", "Qoka umthumeli wempahla bese ubhuka indawo"],
  "Audit certificate": ["Ouditsertifikaat", "Setifikeiti sa tlhahlobo", "Xitifikheti xa nkambelo", "Isitifiketi sokuhlola"],
  "Avocados": ["Avokado's", "Dipheretšisi tša avokado", "Ti-avokhado", "Ama-avokhado"],
  "Banking": ["Bankdienste", "Dipanka", "Tibanka", "Ezamabhange"],
  "Before building a packhouse, store or farm stall, check zoning and building-plan requirements with your local municipality.": ["Voordat jy 'n pakhuis, stoor of plaasstalletjie bou, gaan sonering en bouplanvereistes by jou plaaslike munisipaliteit na.", "Pele o aga ntlo ya go phuthela, polokelo goba setala sa polasa, lekola dinyakego tša go arola naga le dipolane tša go aga le mmasepala wa gago.", "U nga si aka yindlu yo paka, vuhlayiselo kumbe xitolo xa purasi, kambela swilaveko swa ku avanyisa misava na tipulani to aka eka masipala wa wena.", "Ngaphambi kokwakha indlu yokupakisha, isitolo noma isitolo sasepulazini, hlola izidingo zokuhlukaniswa komhlaba nezinhlelo zokwakha kumasipala wakho."],
  "Below the compulsory threshold you may still register voluntarily once turnover passes the minimum for voluntary registration. You can then claim VAT on inputs and may qualify for the diesel refund, but you must file returns. Discuss with an accountant.": ["Onder die verpligte drempel kan jy steeds vrywillig registreer sodra die omset die minimum vir vrywillige registrasie oorskry. Jy kan dan BTW op insette eis en mag vir die dieselterugbetaling kwalifiseer, maar jy moet opgawes indien. Bespreek met 'n rekenmeester.", "Ka fase ga mellwane ye e gapeletšwago o sa ka ngwadiša ka boithaopo ge letseno le feta bonnyane bja ngwadišo ya boithaopo. Ke moka o ka kleima VAT ya ditlabakelo gomme wa swanelega go bušetšwa tšhelete ya disele, eupša o swanetše go romela dipego. Ahlaahla le molaodi wa ditšhelete.", "Ehansi ka mpimo wo boheka u nga ha tsarisa hi ku tirhandzela loko mali leyi nghenaka yi tlula xiyimo xa le hansi xa ku tsarisa hi ku tirhandzela. Kutani u nga kombela VAT ya swipfuno naswona u nga fanelekela ku vuyeriwa mali ya dizele, kambe u fanele ku rhumela swiviko. Burisana na mukamberi wa timali.", "Ngaphansi komkhawulo ophoqelekile usengabhalisa ngokuzithandela uma imali yokuthengisa idlula okuncane okudingekayo ekubhaliseni ngokuzithandela. Ungabe usufuna i-VAT ezintweni zokulima futhi ungafanelekela ukubuyiselwa kwemali kadizili, kodwa kufanele ufake imibiko. Xoxa nomgcini-mabhuku."],
  "BizPortal": ["BizPortal", "BizPortal", "BizPortal", "BizPortal"],
  "Book a short consultation with an accountant. Bring your expected turnover, number of workers and funding plans. A structure is easy to start with and harder to change later.": ["Bespreek 'n kort konsultasie met 'n rekenmeester. Bring jou verwagte omset, aantal werkers en befondsingsplanne. 'n Struktuur is maklik om mee te begin en moeiliker om later te verander.", "Peeletša nako ye kopana le molaodi wa ditšhelete. Tliša letseno leo o le letetšego, palo ya bašomi le maano a thušo ya ditšhelete. Sebopego se bonolo go thoma ka sona eupša go thata go se fetola ka morago.", "Buka ku vulavula nkarhinyana na mukamberi wa timali. Tisa mali leyi u yi languteleke, nhlayo ya vatirhi na tipulani ta mpfuno wa timali. Xivumbeko xi olova ku sungula hi xona kambe xi tika ku xi cinca endzhaku.", "Bhuka ukubonana okufushane nomgcini-mabhuku. Letha imali olindele ukuyithola, inani labasebenzi nezinhlelo zoxhaso. Isakhiwo kulula ukuqala ngaso kodwa kunzima ukusishintsha kamuva."],
  "Book the export inspection": ["Bespreek die uitvoerinspeksie", "Beeletša tlhahlobo ya go romela ntle", "Buka nkambelo wo xavisa ehandle", "Bhuka ukuhlolwa kokuthekelisa"],
  "Book the export inspection with PPECB for the date the consignment will be ready.": ["Bespreek die uitvoerinspeksie by PPECB vir die datum waarop die besending gereed sal wees.", "Beeletša tlhahlobo ya go romela ntle le PPECB ka letšatšikgwedi leo thoto e tlago go loka.", "Buka nkambelo wo xavisa ehandle na PPECB hi siku leri nhundzu yi nga ta va yi lulamile.", "Bhuka ukuhlolwa kokuthekelisa ne-PPECB ngosuku impahla ezobe ilungile ngalo."],
  "Booking confirmation": ["Besprekingsbevestiging", "Netefatšo ya peeletšo", "Ku tiyisisa ku buka", "Isiqinisekiso sokubhuka"],
  "Build your business plan and budget": ["Bou jou sakeplan en begroting", "Aga leano la gago la kgwebo le tekanyetšo", "Aka pulani ya wena ya bindzu na bajete", "Yakha uhlelo lwakho lwebhizinisi nesabelomali"],
  "Business registered and records in order": ["Besigheid geregistreer en rekords in orde", "Kgwebo e ngwadišitšwe gomme direkhoto di le ka thulaganyo", "Bindzu ri tsarisiwile naswona tirekhodo ti hleriwile", "Ibhizinisi libhalisiwe futhi amarekhodi ahlelekile"],
  "Butternut and other squash": ["Botterskorsie en ander pampoene", "Butternut le mehutana ye mengwe ya mapotse", "Butternut na swinkwana swin'wana", "Ithanga (butternut) namanye amathanga"],
  "Buyers increasingly require an ethical-trade social audit covering wages, housing and working conditions.": ["Kopers vereis toenemend 'n etiese-handel sosiale oudit wat lone, behuising en werksomstandighede dek.", "Bareki ba oketša go nyaka tlhahlobo ya leago ya kgwebišano ya maitshwaro yeo e akaretšago meputso, madulo le maemo a mošomo.", "Vaxavi va ya va lava ngopfu nkambelo wa vanhu wa mabindzu ya mahanyelo lowu katsaka miholo, vutshamo na swiyimo swa ntirho.", "Abathengi bafuna kakhulu ukuhlolwa kwezenhlalo kokuhweba ngokuziphatha okuhlanganisa amaholo, izindawo zokuhlala nezimo zokusebenza."],
  "Certificate of origin": ["Sertifikaat van oorsprong", "Setifikeiti sa mathomo", "Xitifikheti xa masungulo", "Isitifiketi semvelaphi"],
  "Certification opens retail and export buyers who pay better and more reliably.": ["Sertifisering open kleinhandel- en uitvoerkopers wat beter en meer betroubaar betaal.", "Setifikeiti se bula barekiši le bareki ba ka ntle bao ba lefago gabotse le ka botshepegi.", "Xitifikheti xi pfula vaxavisi na vaxavi va le handle lava hakelaka kahle na hi ku tshembeka.", "Isitifiketi sivula abathengi bezitolo nabangaphandle abakhokha kangcono nangokwethembeka."],
  "Check EU plant-health, marketing-standard and labelling rules for your product on Access2Markets.": ["Gaan EU-plantgesondheid-, bemarkingstandaard- en etiketteringsreëls vir jou produk op Access2Markets na.", "Lekola melao ya EU ya maphelo a dimela, maemo a go bapatša le go bea maswao bakeng sa setšweletšwa sa gago go Access2Markets.", "Kambela milawu ya EU ya rihanyo ra swimila, swiyimo swa ku xavisa na ku veka swikombiso swa xibuweriwa xa wena eka Access2Markets.", "Hlola imithetho ye-EU yempilo yezitshalo, amazinga okumaketha nokulebula umkhiqizo wakho ku-Access2Markets."],
  "Check import tariffs and preferential trade agreements": ["Gaan invoertariewe en voorkeurhandelsooreenkomste na", "Lekola ditefelo tša go tsenya le ditumelelano tša kgwebišano tša go ratwa", "Kambela tihakelo to nghenisa na swivumelwano swa mabindzu swo hlawuleka", "Hlola izintela zokungenisa nezivumelwano zokuhweba ezikhethekile"],
  "Check maximum residue limits (MRLs)": ["Gaan maksimum residu-limiete (MRL's) na", "Lekola mellwane ye megolo ya mesaletša (MRL)", "Kambela mimpimo leyikulu ya leswi salaka (MRL)", "Hlola imikhawulo ephezulu yezinsalela (ama-MRL)"],
  "Check municipal land-use rules": ["Gaan munisipale grondgebruikreëls na", "Lekola melao ya mmasepala ya tšhomišo ya naga", "Kambela milawu ya masipala ya matirhiselo ya misava", "Hlola imithetho kamasipala yokusetshenziswa komhlaba"],
  "Check that the product is allowed into the destination": ["Gaan na dat die produk in die bestemming toegelaat word", "Lekola gore setšweletšwa se dumeletšwe go tsena moo se yago gona", "Kambela leswaku xibuweriwa xi pfumeleriwile ku nghena laha xi yaka kona", "Hlola ukuthi umkhiqizo uvunyelwe yini ukungena lapho uya khona"],
  "Check whether your water use needs authorisation": ["Gaan na of jou watergebruik magtiging nodig het", "Lekola ge e ba tšhomišo ya gago ya meetse e nyaka tumelelo", "Kambela loko matirhiselo ya wena ya mati ma lava mpfumelelo", "Hlola ukuthi ukusebenzisa kwakho amanzi kudinga imvume yini"],
  "Check your 12-month cash flow": ["Gaan jou 12-maande kontantvloei na", "Lekola phallo ya tšhelete ya gago ya dikgwedi tše 12", "Kambela ku khuluka ka mali ka wena ka tin'hweti ta 12", "Hlola ukugeleza kwemali yakho kwezinyanga eziyi-12"],
  "Choose a forwarder / clearing agent, book container or truck space and agree who arranges insurance (the Incoterms in your sales contract).": ["Kies 'n verskeper / klaringsagent, bespreek houer- of vragmotorruimte en kom ooreen wie versekering reël (die Incoterms in jou verkoopkontrak).", "Kgetha moromi / moemedi wa go phatlalatša, beeletša sebaka sa setshelo goba sa lori gomme le dumelelane gore ke mang yo a beakanyago inšorense (Incoterms konteraking ya gago ya thekišo).", "Hlawula murhumeri / muyimeri wo basisa, buka ndhawu ya khonteyina kumbe ya loli kutani mi pfumelelana leswaku i mani loyi a lulamisaka inxuwalense (Incoterms eka xivumelwano xa wena xa ku xavisa).", "Khetha umthumeli / umenzeli wokukhipha, bhuka indawo yesiqukathi noma yeloli futhi nivumelane ukuthi ubani ohlela umshwalense (ama-Incoterms enkontilekeni yakho yokuthengisa)."],
  "Choose a structure": ["Kies 'n struktuur", "Kgetha sebopego", "Hlawula xivumbeko", "Khetha isakhiwo"],
  "CIPC co-operatives": ["CIPC-koöperasies", "Dikopanelo tša CIPC", "Mintirhisano ya CIPC", "Ubambiswano lwe-CIPC"],
  "CIPC registration certificate": ["CIPC-registrasiesertifikaat", "Setifikeiti sa ngwadišo sa CIPC", "Xitifikheti xa ku tsarisa xa CIPC", "Isitifiketi sokubhalisa se-CIPC"],
  "Citrus - oranges": ["Sitrus - lemoene", "Dinamune - dinamune tša go ja", "Swimila swa malamula - malamula", "Amawolintshi - amawolintshi"],
  "Claim the diesel refund for farming": ["Eis die dieselterugbetaling vir boerdery", "Kleima tšhelete ya disele ye e bušetšwago ya temo", "Kombela mali ya dizele leyi vuyiseriwaka ya vurimi", "Funa ukubuyiselwa kwemali kadizili yezolimo"],
  "Clean records are what turn an informal farm into one a lender can assess.": ["Skoon rekords is wat 'n informele plaas verander in een wat 'n uitlener kan beoordeel.", "Direkhoto tše di hlwekilego ke tšona di fetošago polasa ye e sego ya semmušo gore e be ye moadimi a ka e sekasekago.", "Tirekhodo leti tengeke hi tona ti cincaka purasi leri nga riki ra ximfumo ri va leri muhlayisi wa xikweleti a nga ri kambelaka.", "Amarekhodi ahlanzekile yiwo aguqula ipulazi elingahlelekile libe elingahlolwa ngumboleki."],
  "Cold-chain and temperature plan": ["Koueketting- en temperatuurplan", "Leano la go boloka ka go tonya le la thempereitšha", "Pulani yo hlayisa hi xirhami na ya thempureche", "Uhlelo lokugcina kubanda nelokushisa"],
  "Commercial banks": ["Kommersiële banke", "Dipanka tša kgwebo", "Tibanka ta mabindzu", "Amabhange ezentengiselwano"],
  "Companies and co-operatives must record who ultimately owns or controls them and file this with CIPC, and update it when it changes.": ["Maatskappye en koöperasies moet aanteken wie hulle uiteindelik besit of beheer, dit by CIPC indien, en dit bywerk wanneer dit verander.", "Dikhamphani le dikopanelo di swanetše go ngwala gore ke mang yo a di ruago goba a di laolago mafelelong, ba di romele go CIPC, le go di mpshafatša ge di fetoga.", "Tikhamphani na mintirhisano swi fanele ku tsala leswaku i mani loyi eku heteleleni a swi vaka kumbe a swi lawula, swi swi rhumela eka CIPC, na ku swi pfuxeta loko swi cinca.", "Izinkampani nobambiswano kufanele zibhale ukuthi ngubani ozinikele ekugcineni noma ozilawulayo, zikufake ku-CIPC, futhi zikubuyekeze uma kushintsha."],
  "Compare every product in your spray programme with the destination's maximum residue limits. Limits differ by market and change over time.": ["Vergelyk elke produk in jou spuitprogram met die bestemming se maksimum residu-limiete. Limiete verskil per mark en verander met tyd.", "Bapetša setšweletšwa se sengwe le se sengwe lenaneong la gago la go fafatša le mellwane ye megolo ya mesaletša ya moo go yago. Mellwane e fapana go ya ka mmaraka gomme e fetoga ka nako.", "Pimanisa xibuweriwa xin'wana na xin'wana eka nongonoko wa wena wo fafazela na mimpimo leyikulu ya leswi salaka ya laha swi yaka kona. Mimpimo yi hambana hi makete naswona yi cinca hi nkarhi.", "Qhathanisa umkhiqizo ngamunye ohlelweni lwakho lokufafaza nemikhawulo ephezulu yezinsalela yalapho uya khona. Imikhawulo iyehluka ngemakethe futhi iyashintsha ngokuhamba kwesikhathi."],
  "Compare the three business structures": ["Vergelyk die drie besigheidstrukture", "Bapetša dibopego tše tharo tša kgwebo", "Pimanisa swivumbeko swinharhu swa bindzu", "Qhathanisa izakhiwo ezintathu zebhizinisi"],
  "Compensation Fund": ["Vergoedingsfonds", "Sekhwama sa Matshediso", "Nkwama wa Ndziho", "Isikhwama Sesinxephezelo"],
  "Compliance protects your workers and your reputation with retailers and exporters.": ["Nakoming beskerm jou werkers en jou reputasie by kleinhandelaars en uitvoerders.", "Kobamelo e šireletša bašomi ba gago le botumo bja gago go barekiši le baromela ntle.", "Ku landzela milawu swi sirhelela vatirhi va wena na ndhuma ya wena eka vaxavisi na vaxavisi va le handle.", "Ukuthobela kuvikela abasebenzi bakho nesithunzi sakho kubathengisi nabathekelisi."],
  "Confirm the product, its HS code and the destination": ["Bevestig die produk, sy HS-kode en die bestemming", "Netefatša setšweletšwa, khoutu ya sona ya HS le moo se yago gona", "Tiyisisa xibuweriwa, khodi ya xona ya HS na laha xi yaka kona", "Qinisekisa umkhiqizo, ikhodi yawo ye-HS nendawo oya kuyo"],
  "Consider voluntary VAT registration": ["Oorweeg vrywillige BTW-registrasie", "Nagana ka ngwadišo ya boithaopo ya VAT", "Anakanya hi ku tsarisela VAT hi ku tirhandzela", "Cabanga ngokubhalisela i-VAT ngokuzithandela"],
  "Customs client number": ["Doeanekliëntnommer", "Nomoro ya modirelwa wa customs", "Nomboro ya khastomara ya customs", "Inombolo yekhasimende lamakhastomu"],
  "Department of Agriculture": ["Departement van Landbou", "Kgoro ya Temo", "Ndzawulo ya Vurimi", "uMnyango wezoLimo"],
  "Dept. of Employment and Labour": ["Dept. van Indiensneming en Arbeid", "Kgoro ya Mešomo le Bašomi", "Ndzawulo ya Mitirho na Vatirhi", "uMnyango Wezemisebenzi Nabasebenzi"],
  "Dept. of Water and Sanitation": ["Dept. van Water en Sanitasie", "Kgoro ya Meetse le Kgwerano", "Ndzawulo ya Mati na Vuhlayiseki bya Rihanyo", "uMnyango Wezamanzi Nokuthuthwa Kwendle"],
  "Development finance institutions offer agricultural loans and blended finance. Prepare your business plan, cash-flow forecast, statements and registration documents before applying.": ["Ontwikkelingsfinansieringsinstellings bied landboulenings en gemengde finansiering aan. Berei jou sakeplan, kontantvloeivoorspelling, state en registrasiedokumente voor voordat jy aansoek doen.", "Mekgatlo ya ditšhelete tša tlhabollo e fa dikadimo tša temo le ditšhelete tše di hlakantšwego. Lokišetša leano la gago la kgwebo, kakanyo ya phallo ya tšhelete, ditatemente le ditokumente tša ngwadišo pele o kgopela.", "Swivandla swa timali ta nhluvukiso swi nyika swikweleti swa vurimi na timali leti hlanganisiweke. Lulamisa pulani ya wena ya bindzu, vuprofeta bya ku khuluka ka mali, swiviko na matsalwa ya ku tsarisa u nga si kombela.", "Izikhungo zezimali zentuthuko zinikeza imalimboleko yezolimo nezimali ezixubile. Lungiselela uhlelo lwakho lwebhizinisi, isibikezelo sokugeleza kwemali, izitatimende nemibhalo yokubhalisa ngaphambi kokufaka isicelo."],
  "Diesel is a large cost on most farms; the refund is money you are entitled to.": ["Diesel is 'n groot koste op die meeste plase; die terugbetaling is geld waarop jy geregtig is.", "Disele ke tshenyegelo ye kgolo dipolaseng tše dintši; tšhelete ye e bušetšwago ke tšhelete yeo o e swanelago.", "Dizele i xihlawulo lexikulu eka mapurasi yo tala; mali leyi vuyiseriwaka i mali leyi u yi faneleke.", "Udizili uyizindleko ezinkulu emapulazini amaningi; imali ebuyiselwayo yimali onelungelo kuyo."],
  "Each farm or orchard block that produces for export needs a production unit code so consignments can be traced back to it. Some markets require the unit to be registered specifically for that market.": ["Elke plaas of boordblok wat vir uitvoer produseer, het 'n produksie-eenheidskode nodig sodat besendings daarna teruggespoor kan word. Sommige markte vereis dat die eenheid spesifiek vir daardie mark geregistreer word.", "Polasa ye nngwe le ye nngwe goba sebaka sa serapa se se tšweletšago bakeng sa go romela ntle se nyaka khoutu ya yuniti ya tšweletšo gore dithoto di kgone go latišišwa go fihla go sona. Mebaraka ye mengwe e nyaka gore yuniti e ngwadišwe bakeng sa mmaraka woo.", "Purasi rin'wana na rin'wana kumbe xiphemu xa ntanga lexi humelerisaka ku xavisa ehandle xi lava khodi ya yuniti ya vuhumelerisi leswaku nhundzu yi landzeleriwa ku tlhelela eka xona. Timakete tin'wana ti lava leswaku yuniti yi tsarisiwa eka makete wolowo.", "Ipulazi ngalinye noma ibhulokhi yesivande ekhiqizela ukuthekelisa idinga ikhodi yeyunithi yokukhiqiza ukuze izimpahla zilandelelwe kuze kube kuyo. Ezinye izimakethe zidinga ukuthi iyunithi ibhaliselwe leyo makethe."],
  "Employees": ["Werknemers", "Bašomi", "Vatirhi", "Abasebenzi"],
  "Employer tax obligations are checked when you apply for a tax clearance PIN.": ["Werkgewerbelastingverpligtinge word nagegaan wanneer jy vir 'n belastingklaring-PIN aansoek doen.", "Maikarabelo a motšhelo a bathwadi a lekolwa ge o kgopela PIN ya tumelelo ya motšhelo.", "Vutihlamuleri bya xibalo bya vathori byi kambeliwa loko u kombela PIN ya mpfumelelo wa xibalo.", "Izibopho zentela zomqashi ziyahlolwa uma ufaka isicelo se-PIN yemvume yentela."],
  "EU import requirements and marketing standards": ["EU-invoervereistes en bemarkingstandaarde", "Dinyakego tša go tsenya tša EU le maemo a go bapatša", "Swilaveko swa ku nghenisa swa EU na swiyimo swa ku xavisa", "Izidingo zokungenisa ze-EU namazinga okumaketha"],
  "EU plant-health conditions for citrus": ["EU-plantgesondheidsvoorwaardes vir sitrus", "Maemo a maphelo a dimela a EU bakeng sa dinamune", "Swiyimo swa rihanyo ra swimila swa EU swa malamula", "Imibandela yempilo yezitshalo ye-EU yamawolintshi"],
  "Europe": ["Europa", "Yuropa", "Yuropa", "IYurophu"],
  "European Union": ["Europese Unie", "Kopano ya Yuropa", "Ntlhanganelo wa Yuropa", "Inhlangano YaseYurophu"],
  "Explore funding options": ["Verken befondsingsopsies", "Hlahloba dikgetho tša thušo ya ditšhelete", "Lavisisa swihlawulo swa mpfuno wa timali", "Hlola izindlela zoxhaso"],
  "Export declaration": ["Uitvoerverklaring", "Pego ya go romela ntle", "Xiviko xo xavisa ehandle", "Isimemezelo sokuthekelisa"],
  "Export declaration, invoice, packing list": ["Uitvoerverklaring, faktuur, paklys", "Pego ya go romela ntle, invoice, lenaneo la go phuthela", "Xiviko xo xavisa ehandle, invoyisi, nxaxamelo wo paka", "Isimemezelo sokuthekelisa, i-invoyisi, uhlu lokupakisha"],
  "Exporter registration with PPECB": ["Uitvoerderregistrasie by PPECB", "Ngwadišo ya moromela ntle go PPECB", "Ku tsarisa muxavisi wa le handle eka PPECB", "Ukubhaliswa komthekelisi ku-PPECB"],
  "Exporting needs a registered business. This item is ticked automatically when your Business Companion profile has a registration number.": ["Uitvoer vereis 'n geregistreerde besigheid. Hierdie item word outomaties gemerk wanneer jou Besigheidsbouer-profiel 'n registrasienommer het.", "Go romela ntle go nyaka kgwebo ye e ngwadišitšwego. Selo se se swaiwa ka bogona ge profaele ya gago ya Mohlami wa Kgwebo e na le nomoro ya ngwadišo.", "Ku xavisa ehandle swi lava bindzu leri tsarisiweke. Nchumu lowu wu fungiwa hi woxe loko profayili ya wena ya Muakhi wa Bindzu yi ri na nomboro ya ku tsarisa.", "Ukuthekelisa kudinga ibhizinisi elibhalisiwe. Le nto imakwa ngokuzenzakalelayo uma iphrofayela yakho yoMakhi weBhizinisi inenombolo yokubhalisa."],
  "Exports need registrations with several authorities; starting early avoids missed seasons.": ["Uitvoere vereis registrasies by verskeie owerhede; om vroeg te begin, voorkom gemiste seisoene.", "Go romela ntle go nyaka dingwadišo go balaodi ba mmalwa; go thoma ka pela go thibela go fetwa ke dihla.", "Ku xavisa ehandle swi lava ku tsarisa eka valawuri vo hlayanyana; ku sungula ka ha ri nkarhi swi sivela ku hundzeriwa hi tinguva.", "Ukuthekelisa kudinga ukubhalisa ezikhungweni eziningana; ukuqala kusenesikhathi kuvimbela ukuphuthelwa yizinkathi."],
  "Farm work carries injury risk; without registration the employer can be held liable.": ["Plaaswerk hou beseringsrisiko in; sonder registrasie kan die werkgewer aanspreeklik gehou word.", "Mošomo wa polasa o na le kotsi ya go gobala; ntle le ngwadišo mothwadi a ka ikarabela.", "Ntirho wa purasi wu na khombo ra ku vaviseka; handle ka ku tsarisa muthori a nga tihlamulela.", "Umsebenzi wasepulazini unobungozi bokulimala; ngaphandle kokubhalisa umqashi angabekwa icala."],
  "Farm workers are covered by the national minimum wage and the farm worker sector conditions of employment. Check the current rate each year and give every worker a written contract and payslips.": ["Plaaswerkers word gedek deur die nasionale minimum loon en die diensvoorwaardes vir die plaaswerkersektor. Gaan die huidige koers elke jaar na en gee elke werker 'n geskrewe kontrak en betaalstrokies.", "Bašomi ba dipolasa ba akareditšwe ke moputso wa fase wa naga le maemo a mošomo a lekala la bašomi ba dipolasa. Lekola seroto sa bjale ngwaga le ngwaga gomme o fe mošomi yo mongwe le yo mongwe konteraka ye e ngwadilwego le diphepe tša moputso.", "Vatirhi va mapurasi va katsiwa hi muholo wa le hansi wa tiko na swiyimo swa ntirho swa xiyenge xa vatirhi va mapurasi. Kambela mpimo wa sweswi lembe na lembe kutani u nyika mutirhi un'wana na un'wana xivumelwano lexi tsariweke na swiphepherhele swa muholo.", "Abasebenzi basemapulazini bavikelwa yiholo elincane likazwelonke nemibandela yokuqashwa komkhakha wabasebenzi basemapulazini. Hlola izinga lamanje unyaka nonyaka futhi unikeze isisebenzi ngasinye inkontileka ebhaliwe nama-payslip."],
  "File beneficial ownership information": ["Dien inligting oor voordelige eienaarskap in", "Romela tshedimošo ya bong bja mohola", "Rhumela vuxokoxoko bya vun'wini lebyi vuyerisaka", "Faka ulwazi lobunikazi obunenzuzo"],
  "File VAT201 returns for each tax period. The compliance calendar reminds you 30, 7 and 1 days before each estimated due date.": ["Dien VAT201-opgawes vir elke belastingtydperk in. Die nakomingskalender herinner jou 30, 7 en 1 dag voor elke geskatte vervaldatum.", "Romela dipego tša VAT201 tša nako ye nngwe le ye nngwe ya motšhelo. Khalendara ya kobamelo e go gopotša matšatši a 30, 7 le 1 pele ga letšatšikgwedi le lengwe le le lengwe le le akanywago.", "Rhumela swiviko swa VAT201 swa nkarhi wun'wana na wun'wana wa xibalo. Khalendara ya ku landzela milawu yi ku tsundzuxa masiku ya 30, 7 na 1 ku nga si fika siku rin'wana na rin'wana leri ringanyetiweke.", "Faka imibiko ye-VAT201 yesikhathi ngasinye sentela. Ikhalenda yokuthobela ikukhumbuza izinsuku ezingama-30, 7 no-1 ngaphambi kosuku ngalunye olulinganisiwe."],
  "Final documents": ["Finale dokumente", "Ditokumente tša mafelelo", "Matsalwa yo hetelela", "Imibhalo yokugcina"],
  "Find a registered accountant (SAICA)": ["Vind 'n geregistreerde rekenmeester (SAICA)", "Hwetša molaodi wa ditšhelete yo a ngwadišitšwego (SAICA)", "Kuma mukamberi wa timali loyi a tsarisiweke (SAICA)", "Thola umgcini-mabhuku obhalisiwe (SAICA)"],
  "Follow the pest monitoring and orchard requirements of the export protocol for your market and keep the records.": ["Volg die plaagmonitering- en boordvereistes van die uitvoerprotokol vir jou mark en hou die rekords.", "Latela dinyakego tša go lekola dikokonyana le tša serapa tša tshepedišo ya go romela ntle bakeng sa mmaraka wa gago gomme o boloke direkhoto.", "Landzela swilaveko swo languta swiphiqo na swa ntanga swa nawu wo xavisa ehandle eka makete wa wena kutani u hlayisa tirekhodo.", "Landela izidingo zokuqapha izinambuzane nezesivande zomgomo wokuthekelisa wemakethe yakho futhi ugcine amarekhodi."],
  "For farms with high input costs, VAT registration can improve cash flow.": ["Vir plase met hoë insetkoste kan BTW-registrasie kontantvloei verbeter.", "Bakeng sa dipolasa tše di nago le ditshenyegelo tše di phagamego tša ditlabakelo, ngwadišo ya VAT e ka kaonafatša phallo ya tšhelete.", "Eka mapurasi lama nga na swihlawulo swa le henhla swa swipfuno, ku tsarisela VAT swi nga antswisa ku khuluka ka mali.", "Kumapulazi anezindleko eziphezulu zezinto zokulima, ukubhalisela i-VAT kungathuthukisa ukugeleza kwemali."],
  "Fruit": ["Vrugte", "Dienywa", "Mihandzu", "Izithelo"],
  "Get advice before you decide": ["Kry advies voordat jy besluit", "Hwetša keletšo pele o tšea sephetho", "Kuma switsundzuxo u nga si boha", "Thola iseluleko ngaphambi kokunquma"],
  "Get food-safety certification for retail buyers": ["Kry voedselveiligheidsertifisering vir kleinhandelkopers", "Hwetša setifikeiti sa polokego ya dijo bakeng sa barekiši", "Kuma xitifikheti xa vuhlayiseki bya swakudya eka vaxavisi", "Thola isitifiketi sokuphepha kokudla kubathengisi"],
  "GLOBALG.A.P. / buyers": ["GLOBALG.A.P. / kopers", "GLOBALG.A.P. / bareki", "GLOBALG.A.P. / vaxavi", "I-GLOBALG.A.P. / abathengi"],
  "GLOBALG.A.P. certificate": ["GLOBALG.A.P.-sertifikaat", "Setifikeiti sa GLOBALG.A.P.", "Xitifikheti xa GLOBALG.A.P.", "Isitifiketi se-GLOBALG.A.P."],
  "GLOBALG.A.P. certification": ["GLOBALG.A.P.-sertifisering", "Setifikeiti sa GLOBALG.A.P.", "Xitifikheti xa GLOBALG.A.P.", "Isitifiketi se-GLOBALG.A.P."],
  "Good records make tax returns, audits and loan applications fast.": ["Goeie rekords maak belastingopgawes, oudits en leningsaansoeke vinnig.", "Direkhoto tše dibotse di dira gore dipego tša motšhelo, ditlhahlobo le dikgopelo tša dikadimo di be ka pela.", "Tirekhodo letinene ti endla leswaku swiviko swa xibalo, minkambelo na swikombelo swa swikweleti swi hatlisa.", "Amarekhodi amahle enza imibiko yentela, ukuhlolwa nezicelo zemalimboleko kusheshe."],
  "Have an income tax number and a tax compliance status (TCS) PIN. Exporters, buyers and finance providers ask for it.": ["Hê 'n inkomstebelastingnommer en 'n belastingnakomingstatus- (TCS) PIN. Uitvoerders, kopers en finansieringsverskaffers vra daarvoor.", "Eba le nomoro ya motšhelo wa letseno le PIN ya boemo bja kobamelo ya motšhelo (TCS). Baromela ntle, bareki le bafani ba ditšhelete ba e kgopela.", "Va na nomboro ya xibalo xa mali leyi nghenaka na PIN ya xiyimo xa ku landzela milawu ya xibalo (TCS). Vaxavisi va le handle, vaxavi na vanyiki va timali va yi kombela.", "Yiba nenombolo yentela yemali engenayo ne-PIN yesimo sokuthobela intela (TCS). Abathekelisi, abathengi nabahlinzeki bezimali bayayicela."],
  "Import permit (from buyer)": ["Invoerpermit (van koper)", "Phemiti ya go tsenya (go tšwa go moreki)", "Phemiti yo nghenisa (ku suka eka muxavi)", "Imvume yokungenisa (evela kumthengi)"],
  "Import permit from the destination country": ["Invoerpermit van die bestemmingsland", "Phemiti ya go tsenya go tšwa nageng yeo go yago go yona", "Phemiti yo nghenisa ku suka eka tiko leri swi yaka eka rona", "Imvume yokungenisa evela ezweni okuyiwa kulo"],
  "Importer pre-notification in the EU": ["Invoerder se voorafkennisgewing in die EU", "Tsebišo ya pele ya motsenya ka EU", "Xitiviso xa ka ha ri emahlweni xa munghenisi eka EU", "Isaziso sangaphambili somngenisi e-EU"],
  "Inspection booking": ["Inspeksiebespreking", "Peeletšo ya tlhahlobo", "Ku buka nkambelo", "Ukubhuka ukuhlolwa"],
  "Inspection report": ["Inspeksieverslag", "Pego ya tlhahlobo", "Xiviko xa nkambelo", "Umbiko wokuhlola"],
  "Inspectors check quality, packaging, marking and (where required) phytosanitary status. Keep the inspection report.": ["Inspekteurs gaan gehalte, verpakking, merking en (waar nodig) fitosanitêre status na. Hou die inspeksieverslag.", "Balekodi ba lekola boleng, go phuthela, go swaya le (moo go nyakegago) boemo bja maphelo a dimela. Boloka pego ya tlhahlobo.", "Vakamberi va kambela khwalithi, ku paka, ku funga na (laha swi lavekaka) xiyimo xa rihanyo ra swimila. Hlayisa xiviko xa nkambelo.", "Abahloli bahlola ikhwalithi, ukupakisha, ukumaka futhi (lapho kudingeka khona) isimo sempilo yezitshalo. Gcina umbiko wokuhlola."],
  "Keep a complete record of every application (product, dose, date, block, withholding period). Check withholding periods against your harvest dates for this market.": ["Hou 'n volledige rekord van elke toediening (produk, dosis, datum, blok, onttrekkingstydperk). Gaan onttrekkingstydperke teen jou oesdatums vir hierdie mark na.", "Boloka rekhoto ye e feletšego ya tšhomišo ye nngwe le ye nngwe (setšweletšwa, tekanyo, letšatšikgwedi, sebaka, nako ya go ema). Lekola dinako tša go ema go ya ka matšatši a gago a go buna bakeng sa mmaraka wo.", "Hlayisa rekhodo leyi heleleke ya ku tirhisa kun'wana na kun'wana (xibuweriwa, mpimo, siku, xiphemu, nkarhi wo rindza). Kambela minkarhi yo rindza hi ku ya hi masiku ya wena yo tshovela eka makete lowu.", "Gcina irekhodi eliphelele lokusetshenziswa ngakunye (umkhiqizo, umthamo, usuku, ibhulokhi, isikhathi sokulinda). Hlola izikhathi zokulinda ngokuqhathanisa nezinsuku zakho zokuvuna zale makethe."],
  "Keep farm and personal money apart": ["Hou plaas- en persoonlike geld apart", "Arola tšhelete ya polasa le ya motho", "Hambanisa mali ya purasi na ya munhu", "Hlukanisa imali yepulazi neyomuntu siqu"],
  "Keep invoices, bank statements, payroll and spray records. SARS generally requires records to be kept for five years. Store certificates in the document vault so other modules can reuse them.": ["Hou fakture, bankstate, betaalstaat- en spuitrekords. SARS vereis gewoonlik dat rekords vir vyf jaar gehou word. Stoor sertifikate in die dokumentkluis sodat ander modules dit kan hergebruik.", "Boloka dikgwebišano, ditatemente tša panka, direkhoto tša meputso le tša go fafatša. Gantši SARS e nyaka gore direkhoto di bolokwe mengwaga e mehlano. Boloka disetifikeiti polokelong ya ditokumente gore dikarolo tše dingwe di kgone go di šomiša gape.", "Hlayisa ti-invoyisi, swiviko swa banka, tirekhodo ta miholo na to fafazela. SARS hi ntolovelo yi lava leswaku tirekhodo ti hlayisiwa malembe ya ntlhanu. Hlayisa switifikheti eka vuhlayiselo bya matsalwa leswaku swiphemu swin'wana swi swi tirhisa nakambe.", "Gcina ama-invoyisi, izitatimende zasebhange, amarekhodi amaholo nawokufafaza. Ngokuvamile i-SARS ifuna amarekhodi agcinwe iminyaka emihlanu. Gcina izitifiketi endaweni ephephile yemibhalo ukuze ezinye izingxenye zikwazi ukuzisebenzisa futhi."],
  "Keep records for five years": ["Hou rekords vir vyf jaar", "Boloka direkhoto mengwaga e mehlano", "Hlayisa tirekhodo malembe ya ntlhanu", "Gcina amarekhodi iminyaka emihlanu"],
  "Labour law": ["Arbeidswetgewing", "Molao wa bašomi", "Nawu wa vatirhi", "Umthetho wezabasebenzi"],
  "Land Bank / NEF / SEDFA": ["Land Bank / NEF / SEDFA", "Land Bank / NEF / SEDFA", "Land Bank / NEF / SEDFA", "Land Bank / NEF / SEDFA"],
  "Late or under-estimated provisional tax attracts penalties and interest.": ["Laat of onderskatte voorlopige belasting lok boetes en rente.", "Motšhelo wa nakwana wo o diegilego goba wo o akanyeditšwego fase o tliša dikotlo le tswala.", "Xibalo xa nkarhinyana lexi hlwelaka kumbe lexi ringanyetiweke ehansi xi tisa magandzelo na nzalo.", "Intela yesikhashana ephuzile noma elinganiselwe phansi iletha izinhlawulo nenzalo."],
  "Late VAT returns carry penalties.": ["Laat BTW-opgawes dra boetes.", "Dipego tša VAT tše di diegilego di na le dikotlo.", "Swiviko swa VAT leswi hlwelaka swi na magandzelo.", "Imibiko ye-VAT ephuzile inezinhlawulo."],
  "Lenders and buyers want to see farm money separately from personal money, and it makes expense analysis accurate.": ["Uitleners en kopers wil plaasgeld apart van persoonlike geld sien, en dit maak uitgawe-ontleding akkuraat.", "Baadimi le bareki ba nyaka go bona tšhelete ya polasa e arogane le tšhelete ya motho, gomme se se dira gore tshekatsheko ya ditshenyegelo e nepagale.", "Vahlayisi va swikweleti na vaxavi va lava ku vona mali ya purasi yi hambanile na mali ya munhu, naswona leswi swi endla leswaku nxopaxopo wa swihlawulo wu kongoma.", "Ababoleki nabathengi bafuna ukubona imali yepulazi ihlukene nemali yomuntu siqu, futhi lokhu kwenza ukuhlaziywa kwezindleko kunembe."],
  "Livestock owners must register an identification (brand) mark and mark their animals.": ["Vee-eienaars moet 'n identifikasie- (brand)merk registreer en hul diere merk.", "Beng ba diruiwa ba swanetše go ngwadiša leswao la boitsebišo gomme ba swaye diphoofolo tša bona.", "Vinyi va swifuwo va fanele ku tsarisa mfungho wa vutivikani kutani va funga swiharhi swa vona.", "Abanikazi bemfuyo kufanele babhalise uphawu lokuhlonza futhi baphawule izilwane zabo."],
  "Local municipality": ["Plaaslike munisipaliteit", "Mmasepala wa selegae", "Masipala wa laha kaya", "UMasipala wendawo"],
  "Look for the month where cash is lowest. That is how much working capital or credit you need to get through to harvest.": ["Soek die maand waarin kontant die laagste is. Dit is hoeveel bedryfskapitaal of krediet jy nodig het om tot by die oes te kom.", "Nyaka kgwedi yeo tšhelete e lego tlase kudu. Seo ke bontši bja tšhelete ya go šoma goba sekoloto seo o se nyakago go fihla nakong ya puno.", "Lava n'hweti leyi mali yi nga ehansi ngopfu. Leyo i nhlayo ya mali yo tirha kumbe xikweleti lexi u xi lavaka ku fika eka ntshovelo.", "Bheka inyanga lapho imali iphansi kakhulu. Lokho yinani lemali yokusebenza noma isikweletu osidingayo ukuze ufike ekuvuneni."],
  "Look up the import duty and whether a trade agreement (for example SADC-EU EPA, SACUM-UK EPA or AfCFTA) gives your product a lower rate, and which proof of origin it needs.": ["Soek die invoerreg op en of 'n handelsooreenkoms (byvoorbeeld SAOG-EU EVO, SACUM-VK EVO of AfCFTA) jou produk 'n laer koers gee, en watter bewys van oorsprong dit vereis.", "Nyaka tefelo ya go tsenya le ge e ba tumelelano ya kgwebišano (mohlala SADC-EU EPA, SACUM-UK EPA goba AfCFTA) e fa setšweletšwa sa gago seroto sa fase, le gore ke bohlatse bofe bja mathomo bjo e bo nyakago.", "Lava hakelo yo nghenisa na loko xivumelwano xa mabindzu (xikombiso SADC-EU EPA, SACUM-UK EPA kumbe AfCFTA) xi nyika xibuweriwa xa wena mpimo wa le hansi, na leswaku xi lava vumbhoni byihi bya laha xi humaka kona.", "Bheka intela yokungenisa nokuthi isivumelwano sokuhweba (isibonelo i-SADC-EU EPA, i-SACUM-UK EPA noma i-AfCFTA) sinika umkhiqizo wakho izinga eliphansi yini, nokuthi budinga buphi ubufakazi bemvelaphi."],
  "Make sure the farm (or you, as a sole proprietor) has an income tax number and an eFiling profile. Farm income is taxable; farming has special rules for things like livestock and development costs.": ["Maak seker die plaas (of jy, as eenmansaak) het 'n inkomstebelastingnommer en 'n eFiling-profiel. Plaasinkomste is belasbaar; boerdery het spesiale reëls vir dinge soos vee en ontwikkelingskoste.", "Kgonthiša gore polasa (goba wena, bjalo ka mong wa kgwebo a nnoši) e na le nomoro ya motšhelo wa letseno le profaele ya eFiling. Letseno la polasa le a lefelwa motšhelo; temo e na le melao ye e kgethegilego ya dilo go swana le diruiwa le ditshenyegelo tša tlhabollo.", "Tiyisisa leswaku purasi (kumbe wena, tanihi n'wini wa bindzu a ri yexe) ri na nomboro ya xibalo xa mali leyi nghenaka na profayili ya eFiling. Mali leyi nghenaka ya purasi yi hakeriwa xibalo; vurimi byi na milawu yo hlawuleka ya swilo ku fana na swifuwo na swihlawulo swa nhluvukiso.", "Qiniseka ukuthi ipulazi (noma wena, njengomnikazi oyedwa) linenombolo yentela yemali engenayo nephrofayela ye-eFiling. Imali yepulazi iyatheleswa; ezolimo zinemithetho ekhethekile yezinto ezifana nemfuyo nezindleko zentuthuko."],
  "Many buyers want a residue analysis from an accredited laboratory before harvest.": ["Baie kopers wil voor die oes 'n residu-ontleding van 'n geakkrediteerde laboratorium hê.", "Bareki ba bantši ba nyaka tshekatsheko ya mesaletša go tšwa laborathoring ye e amogetšwego pele ga puno.", "Vaxavi vo tala va lava nxopaxopo wa leswi salaka ku suka eka laboratori leyi amukeriweke ku nga si tshoveriwa.", "Abathengi abaningi bafuna ukuhlaziywa kwezinsalela okuvela elabhorethri egunyaziwe ngaphambi kokuvuna."],
  "Many profitable farms fail because cash runs out before harvest.": ["Baie winsgewende plase misluk omdat kontant voor die oes opraak.", "Dipolasa tše dintši tše di dirago poelo di a palelwa ka gobane tšhelete e fela pele ga puno.", "Mapurasi yo tala lama vuyerisaka ma tsandzeka hikuva mali yi hela ku nga si tshoveriwa.", "Amapulazi amaningi anenzuzo ayahluleka ngoba imali iphela ngaphambi kokuvuna."],
  "Missing filings can block other CIPC transactions.": ["Ontbrekende indienings kan ander CIPC-transaksies blokkeer.", "Dipego tše di sa romelwago di ka thibela ditirišano tše dingwe tša CIPC.", "Swiviko leswi nga rhumeriwangiki swi nga sivela swiendlakalo swin'wana swa CIPC.", "Ukufaka okushodayo kungavimba okunye okwenziwa yi-CIPC."],
  "Mixed accounts hide the farm's real profit.": ["Gemengde rekeninge verberg die plaas se werklike wins.", "Diakhaonte tše di hlakantšwego di uta poelo ya nnete ya polasa.", "Tiakhawunti leti hlanganisiweke ti fihla vuyelo bya xiviri bya purasi.", "Ama-akhawunti axubile afihla inzuzo yangempela yepulazi."],
  "Monitoring records": ["Moniteringsrekords", "Direkhoto tša go lekola", "Tirekhodo to languta", "Amarekhodi okuqapha"],
  "Most European buyers require GLOBALG.A.P. (or an equivalent) certification. It is not a legal requirement but you will struggle to sell without it.": ["Die meeste Europese kopers vereis GLOBALG.A.P.- (of gelykwaardige) sertifisering. Dit is nie 'n wetlike vereiste nie, maar jy sal sukkel om sonder dit te verkoop.", "Bareki ba bantši ba Yuropa ba nyaka setifikeiti sa GLOBALG.A.P. (goba se se lekanago). Ga se nyakego ya molao eupša o tla sokola go rekiša ntle le sona.", "Vaxavi vo tala va Yuropa va lava xitifikheti xa GLOBALG.A.P. (kumbe lexi ringanaka). A hi xilaveko xa nawu kambe u ta karhateka ku xavisa handle ka xona.", "Abathengi abaningi baseYurophu badinga isitifiketi se-GLOBALG.A.P. (noma esilinganayo). Akusona isidingo somthetho kodwa uzokuthola kunzima ukuthengisa ngaphandle kwaso."],
  "Most farming businesses are provisional taxpayers and pay tax in two instalments during the year (IRP6). The compliance calendar shows your estimated dates.": ["Die meeste boerderybesighede is voorlopige belastingbetalers en betaal belasting in twee paaiemente gedurende die jaar (IRP6). Die nakomingskalender wys jou geskatte datums.", "Dikgwebo tše dintši tša temo ke balefamotšhelo wa nakwana gomme ba lefa motšhelo ka dikarolo tše pedi ngwageng (IRP6). Khalendara ya kobamelo e bontšha matšatši a gago a a akanywago.", "Mabindzu yo tala ya vurimi i vahakeri va xibalo xa nkarhinyana naswona va hakela xibalo hi swiphemu swimbirhi hi lembe (IRP6). Khalendara ya ku landzela milawu yi komba masiku ya wena lama ringanyetiweke.", "Amabhizinisi amaningi ezolimo angabakhokhi bentela yesikhashana futhi akhokha intela ngezingxenye ezimbili phakathi nonyaka (IRP6). Ikhalenda yokuthobela ikhombisa izinsuku zakho ezilinganisiwe."],
  "Neighbouring countries often require an import permit for fresh produce and may restrict imports during their own harvest season. Your buyer usually applies; confirm before you plant for export.": ["Buurlande vereis dikwels 'n invoerpermit vir vars produkte en kan invoere tydens hul eie oesseisoen beperk. Jou koper doen gewoonlik aansoek; bevestig voordat jy vir uitvoer plant.", "Dinaga tša boagišani gantši di nyaka phemiti ya go tsenya bakeng sa dijo tše foreše gomme di ka thibela go tsenya nakong ya bona ya puno. Moreki wa gago gantši ke yena a kgopelago; netefatša pele o bjala bakeng sa go romela ntle.", "Matiko ya vaakelani nkarhi wo tala ma lava phemiti yo nghenisa eka swibyariwa leswintshwa naswona ma nga sivela ku nghenisa hi nguva ya vona ya ntshovelo. Muxavi wa wena hi ntolovelo hi yena a kombelaka; tiyisisa u nga si byala ku xavisa ehandle.", "Amazwe angomakhelwane avame ukudinga imvume yokungenisa umkhiqizo omusha futhi angavimba ukungenisa ngesikhathi sawo sokuvuna. Umthengi wakho uvame ukufaka isicelo; qinisekisa ngaphambi kokutshalela ukuthekelisa."],
  "No CIPC registration is needed. Use a clear trading name, register as an individual taxpayer with SARS and keep the farm's records separate from household money.": ["Geen CIPC-registrasie is nodig nie. Gebruik 'n duidelike handelsnaam, registreer as 'n individuele belastingbetaler by SARS en hou die plaas se rekords apart van huishoudelike geld.", "Ga go nyakege ngwadišo ya CIPC. Šomiša leina la kgwebo le le kwešišegago, ngwadiša bjalo ka molefamotšhelo wa motho go SARS gomme o arole direkhoto tša polasa le tšhelete ya lapa.", "A ku laveki ku tsarisa eka CIPC. Tirhisa vito ra bindzu leri twisisekaka, tsarisa tanihi muhakeri wa xibalo wa munhu eka SARS kutani u hambanisa tirekhodo ta purasi na mali ya ndyangu.", "Akudingeki ukubhalisa ku-CIPC. Sebenzisa igama lokuhweba elicacile, bhalisa njengomkhokhi wentela ongumuntu ku-SARS futhi uhlukanise amarekhodi epulazi nemali yasekhaya."],
  "Note how the shipment arrived, any claims, the price achieved and what you would do differently.": ["Teken aan hoe die besending aangekom het, enige eise, die prys behaal en wat jy anders sou doen.", "Ngwala ka moo thoto e fihlilego ka gona, dikleimi dife goba dife, theko ye e hweditšwego le seo o ka se dirago ka tsela ye nngwe.", "Tsala ndlela leyi nhundzu yi fikeke ha yona, swikombelo swa ndziho swin'wana na swin'wana, nxavo lowu kumiweke na leswi a wu ta swi endla hi ndlela yin'wana.", "Bhala ukuthi impahla ifike kanjani, noma yiziphi izimangalo, intengo etholakele nalokho ongakwenza ngokwehlukile."],
  "Obtain the phytosanitary certificate": ["Verkry die fitosanitêre sertifikaat", "Hwetša setifikeiti sa maphelo a dimela", "Kuma xitifikheti xa rihanyo ra swimila", "Thola isitifiketi sempilo yezitshalo"],
  "Only use products registered for your crop, follow the label (dose, withholding period, protective equipment) and record every application.": ["Gebruik slegs produkte wat vir jou gewas geregistreer is, volg die etiket (dosis, onttrekkingstydperk, beskermende toerusting) en teken elke toediening aan.", "Šomiša fela ditšweletšwa tše di ngwadišitšwego bakeng sa sebjalo sa gago, latela leswao (tekanyo, nako ya go ema, didirišwa tša tšhireletšo) gomme o ngwale tšhomišo ye nngwe le ye nngwe.", "Tirhisa ntsena swibuweriwa leswi tsarisiweke eka ximila xa wena, landzela xikombiso (mpimo, nkarhi wo rindza, switirhisiwa swo sirhelela) kutani u tsala ku tirhisa kun'wana na kun'wana.", "Sebenzisa kuphela imikhiqizo ebhaliselwe isitshalo sakho, landela ilebula (umthamo, isikhathi sokulinda, izinto zokuzivikela) futhi ubhale ukusetshenziswa ngakunye."],
  "Open a separate business bank account": ["Open 'n aparte besigheidsbankrekening", "Bula akhaonte ya panka ya kgwebo ye e ikemetšego", "Pfula akhawunti ya banka ya bindzu leyi hambaneke", "Vula i-akhawunti yebhange yebhizinisi ehlukile"],
  "Open an account in the farm's name (or a dedicated account if you are a sole proprietor). Take your registration documents and ID.": ["Open 'n rekening in die plaas se naam (of 'n toegewyde rekening as jy 'n eenmansaak is). Neem jou registrasiedokumente en ID saam.", "Bula akhaonte ka leina la polasa (goba akhaonte ye e beetšwego yona fela ge o le mong wa kgwebo a nnoši). Tšea ditokumente tša gago tša ngwadišo le ID.", "Pfula akhawunti hi vito ra purasi (kumbe akhawunti leyi hlawuleriweke loko u ri n'wini wa bindzu a ri yexe). Teka matsalwa ya wena ya ku tsarisa na ID.", "Vula i-akhawunti egameni lepulazi (noma i-akhawunti ehlukile uma ungumnikazi oyedwa). Thatha imibhalo yakho yokubhalisa ne-ID."],
  "Open the Export Readiness module, choose a product and destination and work through the requirements grouped by authority.": ["Maak die Uitvoergereedheid-module oop, kies 'n produk en bestemming en werk deur die vereistes, gegroepeer volgens owerheid.", "Bula karolo ya Go itokišetša go Romela Ntle, kgetha setšweletšwa le moo se yago gona gomme o šome ka dinyakego tše di hlophilwego go ya ka bolaodi.", "Pfula xiphemu xa Ku Tilulamisela ku Xavisa Ehandle, hlawula xibuweriwa na laha xi yaka kona kutani u tirha hi swilaveko leswi hlanganisiweke hi vulawuri.", "Vula ingxenye yokuLungela Ukuthekelisa, khetha umkhiqizo nendawo eya kuyo bese usebenza ngezidingo eziqoqwe ngesiphathimandla."],
  "Pack and label to the destination's rules and the buyer's specification: product, class, count or size, packhouse and production unit codes, country of origin.": ["Verpak en etiketteer volgens die bestemming se reëls en die koper se spesifikasie: produk, klas, telling of grootte, pakhuis- en produksie-eenheidkodes, land van oorsprong.", "Phuthela le go bea maswao go ya ka melao ya moo go yago le tlhalošo ya moreki: setšweletšwa, sehlopha, palo goba bogolo, dikhoutu tša ntlo ya go phuthela le yuniti ya tšweletšo, naga ya mathomo.", "Paka u veka swikombiso hi ku ya hi milawu ya laha swi yaka kona na nhlamuselo ya muxavi: xibuweriwa, ntlawa, nhlayo kumbe vukulu, tikhodi ta yindlu yo paka na yuniti ya vuhumelerisi, tiko ra laha swi humaka kona.", "Pakisha futhi ulebule ngokwemithetho yalapho kuyiwa khona nemininingwane yomthengi: umkhiqizo, isigaba, inani noma ubukhulu, amakhodi endlu yokupakisha neyunithi yokukhiqiza, izwe lemvelaphi."],
  "Packaging and labelling": ["Verpakking en etikettering", "Go phuthela le go bea maswao", "Ku paka na ku veka swikombiso", "Ukupakisha nokulebula"],
  "Packhouse code": ["Pakhuiskode", "Khoutu ya ntlo ya go phuthela", "Khodi ya yindlu yo paka", "Ikhodi yendlu yokupakisha"],
  "Packing specification": ["Verpakkingspesifikasie", "Tlhalošo ya go phuthela", "Nhlamuselo ya ku paka", "Imininingwane yokupakisha"],
  "Pass the export inspection": ["Slaag die uitvoerinspeksie", "Phasa tlhahlobo ya go romela ntle", "Pasa nkambelo wo xavisa ehandle", "Phumelela ukuhlolwa kokuthekelisa"],
  "Pay at least the national minimum wage and use written contracts": ["Betaal ten minste die nasionale minimum loon en gebruik geskrewe kontrakte", "Lefa bonyane moputso wa fase wa naga gomme o šomiše dikonteraka tše di ngwadilwego", "Hakela kwalomu ka muholo wa le hansi wa tiko kutani u tirhisa swivumelwano leswi tsariweke", "Khokha okungenani iholo elincane likazwelonke futhi usebenzise izinkontileka ezibhaliwe"],
  "Pay yourself a fixed monthly drawing from the farm account instead of using it for household purchases. Upload statements monthly so the platform can flag personal spending.": ["Betaal jouself 'n vaste maandelikse onttrekking uit die plaasrekening in plaas daarvan om dit vir huishoudelike aankope te gebruik. Laai state maandeliks op sodat die platform persoonlike besteding kan merk.", "Ipatele tšhelete ye e beilwego kgwedi le kgwedi go tšwa akhaonteng ya polasa go e na le go e šomišetša go reka tša lapa. Romela ditatemente kgwedi le kgwedi gore sethala se kgone go swaya tšhomišo ya tšhelete ya motho.", "Tihakele mali leyi vekiweke n'hweti na n'hweti ku suka eka akhawunti ya purasi ematshan'wini yo yi tirhisela ku xava swa ndyangu. Rhumela swiviko n'hweti na n'hweti leswaku xiyimo xi kota ku funga matirhiselo ya mali ya munhu.", "Zikhokhele imali egxilile nyanga zonke evela ku-akhawunti yepulazi esikhundleni sokuyisebenzisela ukuthenga okwasekhaya. Layisha izitatimende nyanga zonke ukuze inkundla ikwazi ukumaka ukusetshenziswa kwemali komuntu siqu."],
  "Permits": ["Permitte", "Diphemiti", "Tiphemiti", "Izimvume"],
  "Pest monitoring for the market programme": ["Plaagmonitering vir die markprogram", "Go lekola dikokonyana bakeng sa lenaneo la mmaraka", "Ku languta swiphiqo eka nongonoko wa makete", "Ukuqapha izinambuzane zohlelo lwemakethe"],
  "Phytosanitary certificate": ["Fitosanitêre sertifikaat", "Setifikeiti sa maphelo a dimela", "Xitifikheti xa rihanyo ra swimila", "Isitifiketi sempilo yezitshalo"],
  "Plan and fund": ["Beplan en befonds", "Rulaganya le go hwetša thušo ya ditšhelete", "Pulana na ku kuma mpfuno wa timali", "Hlela futhi uthole uxhaso"],
  "Platform": ["Platform", "Sethala", "Xiyimo", "Inkundla"],
  "Platform guidance": ["Platformriglyne", "Tlhahlo ya sethala", "Nkongomiso wa xiyimo", "Umhlahlandlela wenkundla"],
  "Pre-harvest residue test": ["Residutoets voor oes", "Teko ya mesaletša pele ga puno", "Ndzingo wa leswi salaka ku nga si tshoveriwa", "Ukuhlolwa kwezinsalela ngaphambi kokuvuna"],
  "Produce must be packed in a packhouse with a packhouse code approved for the market. If you pack yourself, register your packhouse; otherwise confirm your packhouse's registration.": ["Produkte moet verpak word in 'n pakhuis met 'n pakhuiskode wat vir die mark goedgekeur is. As jy self verpak, registreer jou pakhuis; andersins bevestig jou pakhuis se registrasie.", "Dijo di swanetše go phuthelwa ntlong ya go phuthela ye e nago le khoutu ye e dumeletšwego bakeng sa mmaraka. Ge o phuthela ka noši, ngwadiša ntlo ya gago ya go phuthela; ge go se bjalo netefatša ngwadišo ya ntlo ya gago ya go phuthela.", "Swibyariwa swi fanele ku pakiwa eka yindlu yo paka leyi nga na khodi leyi pfumeleriweke eka makete. Loko u paka hi wexe, tsarisa yindlu ya wena yo paka; loko swi nga ri tano tiyisisa ku tsarisiwa ka yindlu ya wena yo paka.", "Umkhiqizo kufanele upakishwe endlini yokupakisha enekhodi evunyelwe yemakethe. Uma uzipakishela, bhalisa indlu yakho yokupakisha; uma kungenjalo qinisekisa ukubhaliswa kwendlu yakho yokupakisha."],
  "Proof of origin": ["Bewys van oorsprong", "Bohlatse bja mathomo", "Vumbhoni bya laha swi humaka kona", "Ubufakazi bemvelaphi"],
  "Proof of origin for EU preference": ["Bewys van oorsprong vir EU-voorkeur", "Bohlatse bja mathomo bakeng sa tlhompho ya EU", "Vumbhoni bya laha swi humaka kona eka nhlawulo wa EU", "Ubufakazi bemvelaphi bokukhethwa kwe-EU"],
  "Proof of origin for UK preference": ["Bewys van oorsprong vir VK-voorkeur", "Bohlatse bja mathomo bakeng sa tlhompho ya UK", "Vumbhoni bya laha swi humaka kona eka nhlawulo wa UK", "Ubufakazi bemvelaphi bokukhethwa kwe-UK"],
  "PUC confirmation": ["PUC-bevestiging", "Netefatšo ya PUC", "Ku tiyisisa ka PUC", "Isiqinisekiso se-PUC"],
  "Record the outcome and lessons": ["Teken die uitkoms en lesse aan", "Ngwala poelo le dithuto", "Tsala mbuyelo na tidyondzo", "Bhala umphumela nezifundo"],
  "Records": ["Rekords", "Direkhoto", "Tirekhodo", "Amarekhodi"],
  "Register a co-operative": ["Registreer 'n koöperasie", "Ngwadiša kopanelo", "Tsarisa ntirhisano", "Bhalisa ubambiswano"],
  "Register a private company (Pty) Ltd": ["Registreer 'n privaatmaatskappy (Edms.) Bpk.", "Ngwadiša khamphani ya praebete (Pty) Ltd", "Tsarisa khamphani ya le xihundleni (Pty) Ltd", "Bhalisa inkampani ezimele (Pty) Ltd"],
  "Register as an employer for UIF": ["Registreer as 'n werkgewer vir UIF", "Ngwadiša bjalo ka mothwadi bakeng sa UIF", "Tsarisa tanihi muthori eka UIF", "Bhalisa njengomqashi ku-UIF"],
  "Register as an employer with SARS, deduct PAYE where wages are above the tax threshold, and pay monthly with the EMP201. Skills Development Levy applies once annual payroll passes the SARS threshold.": ["Registreer as 'n werkgewer by SARS, hou LBS terug waar lone bo die belastingdrempel is, en betaal maandeliks met die EMP201. Vaardigheidsontwikkelingsheffing is van toepassing sodra die jaarlikse betaalstaat die SARS-drempel oorskry.", "Ngwadiša bjalo ka mothwadi go SARS, ntšha PAYE moo meputso e fetago mellwane ya motšhelo, gomme o lefe kgwedi le kgwedi ka EMP201. Lekgetho la Tlhabollo ya Mabokgoni le a šoma ge meputso ya ngwaga e feta mellwane ya SARS.", "Tsarisa tanihi muthori eka SARS, susa PAYE laha miholo yi tlulaka mpimo wa xibalo, kutani u hakela n'hweti na n'hweti hi EMP201. Xibalo xa Nhluvukiso wa Vutshila xi tirha loko miholo ya lembe yi tlula mpimo wa SARS.", "Bhalisa njengomqashi ku-SARS, ukhiphe i-PAYE lapho amaholo engaphezu komkhawulo wentela, futhi ukhokhe nyanga zonke nge-EMP201. Intela Yokuthuthukiswa Kwamakhono iyasebenza uma amaholo onyaka edlula umkhawulo we-SARS."],
  "Register as an exporter of regulated perishable products and obtain your exporter (FBO) code, which is used for traceability and to book inspections.": ["Registreer as 'n uitvoerder van gereguleerde bederfbare produkte en kry jou uitvoerder- (FBO)kode, wat vir naspeurbaarheid en om inspeksies te bespreek, gebruik word.", "Ngwadiša bjalo ka moromela ntle wa ditšweletšwa tše di bolago tše di laolwago gomme o hwetše khoutu ya gago ya moromela ntle (FBO), yeo e šomišwago go latišiša le go beeletša ditlhahlobo.", "Tsarisa tanihi muxavisi wa le handle wa swibuweriwa leswi bolaka leswi lawuriwaka kutani u kuma khodi ya wena ya muxavisi (FBO), leyi tirhisiwaka ku landzelerisa na ku buka minkambelo.", "Bhalisa njengomthekelisi wemikhiqizo ebolayo elawulwayo bese uthola ikhodi yakho yomthekelisi (FBO), esetshenziselwa ukulandelela nokubhuka ukuhlolwa."],
  "Register for income tax and eFiling": ["Registreer vir inkomstebelasting en eFiling", "Ngwadišetša motšhelo wa letseno le eFiling", "Tsarisela xibalo xa mali leyi nghenaka na eFiling", "Bhalisela intela yemali engenayo ne-eFiling"],
  "Register for PAYE (and SDL if it applies)": ["Registreer vir LBS (en VHO indien van toepassing)", "Ngwadišetša PAYE (le SDL ge e amega)", "Tsarisela PAYE (na SDL loko swi khumba)", "Bhalisela i-PAYE (ne-SDL uma kusebenza)"],
  "Register for VAT (compulsory at your turnover)": ["Registreer vir BTW (verpligtend by jou omset)", "Ngwadišetša VAT (e gapeletšwa go letseno la gago)", "Tsarisela VAT (swa boheka eka mali leyi u yi kumaka)", "Bhalisela i-VAT (kuyaphoqelelwa enanini lakho lokuthengisa)"],
  "Register on BizPortal": ["Registreer op BizPortal", "Ngwadiša go BizPortal", "Tsarisa eka BizPortal", "Bhalisa ku-BizPortal"],
  "Register online with your ID, the reserved name and director details. You receive a registration certificate (keep it in the document vault). Companies are normally registered for income tax with SARS at the same time - confirm on eFiling.": ["Registreer aanlyn met jou ID, die bespreekte naam en direkteursbesonderhede. Jy ontvang 'n registrasiesertifikaat (hou dit in die dokumentkluis). Maatskappye word gewoonlik terselfdertyd by SARS vir inkomstebelasting geregistreer - bevestig op eFiling.", "Ngwadiša inthaneteng ka ID ya gago, leina le le beeleditšwego le dintlha tša balaodi. O amogela setifikeiti sa ngwadišo (se boloke polokelong ya ditokumente). Gantši dikhamphani di ngwadišwa go SARS bakeng sa motšhelo wa letseno ka nako yona yeo - netefatša go eFiling.", "Tsarisa eka inthanete hi ID ya wena, vito leri hlayiseriweke na vuxokoxoko bya vatlhamuseri. U kuma xitifikheti xa ku tsarisa (xi hlayise eka vuhlayiselo bya matsalwa). Hi ntolovelo tikhamphani ti tsarisiwa eka SARS eka xibalo xa mali leyi nghenaka hi nkarhi wolowo - tiyisisa eka eFiling.", "Bhalisa ku-inthanethi nge-ID yakho, igama elibekisiwe nemininingwane yabaqondisi. Uthola isitifiketi sokubhalisa (sigcine endaweni ephephile yemibhalo). Ngokuvamile izinkampani zibhaliselwa intela yemali engenayo ku-SARS ngesikhathi esifanayo - qinisekisa ku-eFiling."],
  "Register the business": ["Registreer die besigheid", "Ngwadiša kgwebo", "Tsarisa bindzu", "Bhalisa ibhizinisi"],
  "Register the production unit (PUC)": ["Registreer die produksie-eenheid (PUC)", "Ngwadiša yuniti ya tšweletšo (PUC)", "Tsarisa yuniti ya vuhumelerisi (PUC)", "Bhalisa iyunithi yokukhiqiza (PUC)"],
  "Register with SARS Customs as an exporter": ["Registreer by SARS Doeane as 'n uitvoerder", "Ngwadiša go SARS Customs bjalo ka moromela ntle", "Tsarisa eka SARS Customs tanihi muxavisi wa le handle", "Bhalisa ku-SARS Customs njengomthekelisi"],
  "Register with the Compensation Fund (COIDA)": ["Registreer by die Vergoedingsfonds (COIDA)", "Ngwadiša go Sekhwama sa Matshediso (COIDA)", "Tsarisa eka Nkwama wa Ndziho (COIDA)", "Bhalisa esiKhwameni Sesinxephezelo (COIDA)"],
  "Register with the Compensation Fund and submit the annual Return of Earnings. This covers workers injured on duty.": ["Registreer by die Vergoedingsfonds en dien die jaarlikse Opgawe van Verdienste in. Dit dek werkers wat op diens beseer word.", "Ngwadiša go Sekhwama sa Matshediso gomme o romele Pego ya Mogolo ya ngwaga. Se se akaretša bašomi bao ba gobalago mošomong.", "Tsarisa eka Nkwama wa Ndziho kutani u rhumela Xiviko xa Miholo xa lembe. Leswi swi katsa vatirhi lava vavisekaka entirhweni.", "Bhalisa esiKhwameni Sesinxephezelo bese ufaka uMbiko Wemiholo waminyaka yonke. Lokhu kuvikela abasebenzi abalimala emsebenzini."],
  "Register with the Unemployment Insurance Fund and declare your workers monthly (uFiling).": ["Registreer by die Werkloosheidsversekeringsfonds en verklaar jou werkers maandeliks (uFiling).", "Ngwadiša go Sekhwama sa Inšorense ya Go hloka Mošomo gomme o tsebiše ka bašomi ba gago kgwedi le kgwedi (uFiling).", "Tsarisa eka Nkwama wa Inxuwalense ya Vuhava bya Ntirho kutani u tivisa hi vatirhi va wena n'hweti na n'hweti (uFiling).", "Bhalisa esiKhwameni soMshwalense Wokungasebenzi bese umemezela abasebenzi bakho nyanga zonke (uFiling)."],
  "Register your livestock brand mark": ["Registreer jou veebrandmerk", "Ngwadiša leswao la gago la diruiwa", "Tsarisa mfungho wa wena wa swifuwo", "Bhalisa uphawu lwakho lwemfuyo"],
  "Registration confirmation": ["Registrasiebevestiging", "Netefatšo ya ngwadišo", "Ku tiyisisa ku tsarisa", "Isiqinisekiso sokubhalisa"],
  "Registration gives the farm its own legal identity, which buyers, banks and the export module check.": ["Registrasie gee die plaas sy eie regsidentiteit, wat kopers, banke en die uitvoermodule nagaan.", "Ngwadišo e fa polasa boitsebišo bja yona bja molao, bjo bareki, dipanka le karolo ya go romela ntle di bo lekolago.", "Ku tsarisa ku nyika purasi vutivikani bya rona bya nawu, lebyi vaxavi, tibanka na xiphemu xo xavisa ehandle swi byi kambelaka.", "Ukubhalisa kunika ipulazi ubunikazi balo bomthetho, obuhlolwa ngabathengi, amabhange nengxenye yokuthekelisa."],
  "Reserve a business name": ["Bespreek 'n besigheidsnaam", "Beeletša leina la kgwebo", "Hlayisela vito ra bindzu", "Bekisa igama lebhizinisi"],
  "Reserve one or more proposed names online. Have alternatives ready in case your first choice is taken.": ["Bespreek een of meer voorgestelde name aanlyn. Hou alternatiewe gereed ingeval jou eerste keuse reeds geneem is.", "Beeletša leina le tee goba a mantši a šišinywago inthaneteng. Lokišetša a mangwe ge e ba la mathomo le šetše le tšerwe.", "Hlayisela vito rin'we kumbe yo tala leyi ringanyetiweke eka inthanete. Lulamisela man'wana loko vito ro sungula se ri tekiwile.", "Bekisa igama elilodwa noma amaningi ahlongozwayo ku-inthanethi. Lungiselela amanye uma elokuqala selithathiwe."],
  "Residue report": ["Residuverslag", "Pego ya mesaletša", "Xiviko xa leswi salaka", "Umbiko wezinsalela"],
  "Run the pest monitoring and orchard-sanitation programme required for your market (for example false codling moth and fruit fly monitoring) and keep the records.": ["Voer die plaagmonitering- en boordsanitasieprogram uit wat vir jou mark vereis word (byvoorbeeld valskodlingmot- en vrugtevliegmonitering) en hou die rekords.", "Phethagatša lenaneo la go lekola dikokonyana le la bohlweki bja serapa leo le nyakwago ke mmaraka wa gago (mohlala go lekola false codling moth le dintšhi tša dienywa) gomme o boloke direkhoto.", "Endla nongonoko wo languta swiphiqo na wo basisa ntanga lowu laviwaka hi makete wa wena (xikombiso ku languta false codling moth na tinhunguvani ta mihandzu) kutani u hlayisa tirekhodo.", "Qhuba uhlelo lokuqapha izinambuzane nokuhlanzeka kwesivande oludingwa yimakethe yakho (isibonelo ukuqapha i-false codling moth nezimpukane zezithelo) futhi ugcine amarekhodi."],
  "SADC / AfCFTA certificate of origin": ["SAOG / AfCFTA-sertifikaat van oorsprong", "Setifikeiti sa mathomo sa SADC / AfCFTA", "Xitifikheti xa masungulo xa SADC / AfCFTA", "Isitifiketi semvelaphi se-SADC / AfCFTA"],
  "SADC neighbours (e.g. Botswana, Namibia) under SADC / AfCFTA": ["SAOG-bure (bv. Botswana, Namibië) onder SAOG / AfCFTA", "Baagišane ba SADC (mohl. Botswana, Namibia) ka fase ga SADC / AfCFTA", "Vaakelani va SADC (xik. Botswana, Namibia) ehansi ka SADC / AfCFTA", "Omakhelwane be-SADC (isb. iBotswana, iNamibia) ngaphansi kwe-SADC / AfCFTA"],
  "SAICA directory": ["SAICA-gids", "Lenaneo la SAICA", "Xikombo xa SAICA", "Uhlu lwe-SAICA"],
  "SARS diesel refund": ["SARS-dieselterugbetaling", "Go bušetšwa ga tšhelete ya disele ga SARS", "Ku vuyiseriwa mali ya dizele ka SARS", "Ukubuyiselwa kwemali kadizili kwe-SARS"],
  "SARS eFiling": ["SARS eFiling", "SARS eFiling", "SARS eFiling", "SARS eFiling"],
  "SARS employer": ["SARS-werkgewer", "Mothwadi wa SARS", "Muthori wa SARS", "Umqashi we-SARS"],
  "SARS provisional tax": ["SARS voorlopige belasting", "Motšhelo wa nakwana wa SARS", "Xibalo xa nkarhinyana xa SARS", "Intela yesikhashana ye-SARS"],
  "SARS record keeping": ["SARS-rekordhouding", "Go boloka direkhoto ga SARS", "Ku hlayisa tirekhodo ka SARS", "Ukugcinwa kwamarekhodi kwe-SARS"],
  "Set up as a sole proprietor": ["Stel op as 'n eenmansaak", "Ithome bjalo ka mong wa kgwebo a nnoši", "Tisungula tanihi n'wini wa bindzu a ri yexe", "Qala njengomnikazi webhizinisi oyedwa"],
  "Social audit (for example SIZA)": ["Sosiale oudit (byvoorbeeld SIZA)", "Tlhahlobo ya leago (mohlala SIZA)", "Nkambelo wa vanhu (xikombiso SIZA)", "Ukuhlolwa kwezenhlalo (isibonelo i-SIZA)"],
  "Sole proprietor: simplest and cheapest, but you are personally liable for farm debts and the farm income is taxed as your own. Private company (Pty) Ltd: a separate legal person that limits your personal liability, needs CIPC registration and annual returns, and is often preferred by lenders and big buyers. Co-operative: owned by its members (at least five people), suits groups of farmers who buy inputs or sell produce together.": ["Eenmansaak: die eenvoudigste en goedkoopste, maar jy is persoonlik aanspreeklik vir plaasskuld en die plaasinkomste word as jou eie belas. Privaatmaatskappy (Edms.) Bpk.: 'n afsonderlike regspersoon wat jou persoonlike aanspreeklikheid beperk, CIPC-registrasie en jaarlikse opgawes vereis, en dikwels deur uitleners en groot kopers verkies word. Koöperasie: besit deur sy lede (ten minste vyf mense), geskik vir groepe boere wat insette saam koop of produkte saam verkoop.", "Mong wa kgwebo a nnoši: e bonolo le ya theko ye tlase, eupša o ikarabela ka noši ka dikoloto tša polasa gomme letseno la polasa le lefišwa motšhelo bjalo ka la gago. Khamphani ya praebete (Pty) Ltd: motho wa molao yo a ikemetšego yo a fokotšago maikarabelo a gago, e nyaka ngwadišo ya CIPC le dipego tša ngwaga, gomme gantši e ratwa ke baadimi le bareki ba bagolo. Kopanelo (co-operative): ke ya maloko a yona (bonyane batho ba bahlano), e loketše dihlopha tša balemi tšeo di rekago ditlabakelo goba di rekišago dijo mmogo.", "N'wini wa bindzu a ri yexe: yi olova naswona yi chipile, kambe u tihlamulela hi wexe eka swikweleti swa purasi naswona mali leyi nghenaka ya purasi yi hakeriwa xibalo tanihi ya wena. Khamphani ya le xihundleni (Pty) Ltd: munhu wa nawu loyi a tiyimeleke loyi a hungutaka vutihlamuleri bya wena, yi lava ku tsarisiwa eka CIPC na swiviko swa lembe, naswona nkarhi wo tala yi tsakeriwa hi vahlayisi va swikweleti na vaxavi lavakulu. Ntirhisano (co-operative): yi ri ya swirho swa yona (kwalomu ka vanhu va ntlhanu), yi fanela mintlawa ya varimi leyi xavaka swipfuno kumbe yi xavisaka swibyariwa swin'we.", "Umnikazi oyedwa: kulula futhi kushibhile kakhulu, kodwa uzibophezela wena siqu ezikweletini zepulazi futhi imali yepulazi itheleswa njengeyakho. Inkampani ezimele (Pty) Ltd: umuntu womthetho ozimele onciphisa isikweletu sakho, idinga ukubhaliswa ku-CIPC nemibiko yonyaka, futhi kaningi ikhethwa ababoleki nabathengi abakhulu. Ubambiswano (co-operative): lungelamalungu alo (okungenani abantu abahlanu), lufanele amaqembu abalimi athenga izinto zokulima noma athengisa umkhiqizo ndawonye."],
  "Spray programme": ["Spuitprogram", "Lenaneo la go fafatša", "Nongonoko wo fafazela", "Uhlelo lokufafaza"],
  "Spray records": ["Spuitrekords", "Direkhoto tša go fafatša", "Tirekhodo to fafazela", "Amarekhodi okufafaza"],
  "Spray records are required by retailers and every export market, and protect workers and buyers.": ["Spuitrekords word deur kleinhandelaars en elke uitvoermark vereis, en beskerm werkers en kopers.", "Direkhoto tša go fafatša di nyakwa ke barekiši le mmaraka o mongwe le o mongwe wa go romela ntle, gomme di šireletša bašomi le bareki.", "Tirekhodo to fafazela ti laviwa hi vaxavisi na makete wun'wana na wun'wana wa le handle, naswona ti sirhelela vatirhi na vaxavi.", "Amarekhodi okufafaza afunwa abathengisi nayo yonke imakethe yokuthekelisa, futhi avikela abasebenzi nabathengi."],
  "Spray records checked against destination MRLs": ["Spuitrekords teen bestemming se MRL's nagegaan", "Direkhoto tša go fafatša di lekotšwe go ya ka MRL tša moo go yago", "Tirekhodo to fafazela ti kamberiwile hi ku ya hi ti-MRL ta laha swi yaka kona", "Amarekhodi okufafaza ahlolwe ngokuqhathanisa nama-MRL alapho kuyiwa khona"],
  "Start an export-readiness checklist": ["Begin 'n uitvoergereedheid-kontrolelys", "Thoma lenaneo la go itokišetša go romela ntle", "Sungula nxaxamelo wo tilulamisela ku xavisa ehandle", "Qala uhlu lokulungela ukuthekelisa"],
  "Submit VAT returns on time": ["Dien BTW-opgawes betyds in", "Romela dipego tša VAT ka nako", "Rhumela swiviko swa VAT hi nkarhi", "Faka imibiko ye-VAT ngesikhathi"],
  "Supermarket groups usually require GLOBALG.A.P. or a local food-safety standard, plus a social audit. Start with a gap analysis.": ["Supermarkgroepe vereis gewoonlik GLOBALG.A.P. of 'n plaaslike voedselveiligheidstandaard, plus 'n sosiale oudit. Begin met 'n gapingsontleding.", "Dihlopha tša disupamakete gantši di nyaka GLOBALG.A.P. goba maemo a selegae a polokego ya dijo, gotee le tlhahlobo ya leago. Thoma ka tshekatsheko ya dikgaogano.", "Mintlawa ya tisupamakete hi ntolovelo yi lava GLOBALG.A.P. kumbe xiyimo xa laha kaya xa vuhlayiseki bya swakudya, swin'we na nkambelo wa vanhu. Sungula hi nxopaxopo wa leswi pfumalekaka.", "Amaqembu amasupamakethe avame ukufuna i-GLOBALG.A.P. noma izinga lendawo lokuphepha kokudla, kanye nokuhlolwa kwezenhlalo. Qala ngokuhlaziya izikhala."],
  "Taking water from a borehole, river or dam for irrigation may be allowed under Schedule 1 or a General Authorisation, or may need a water use licence. Check with the Department of Water and Sanitation before expanding irrigation.": ["Water uit 'n boorgat, rivier of dam vir besproeiing neem, kan onder Bylae 1 of 'n Algemene Magtiging toegelaat word, of kan 'n watergebruiklisensie benodig. Kontak die Departement van Water en Sanitasie voordat jy besproeiing uitbrei.", "Go tšea meetse sedibeng, nokeng goba letamong bakeng sa go nošetša go ka dumelelwa ka fase ga Šetule 1 goba Tumelelo ya Kakaretšo, goba go ka nyaka laesense ya tšhomišo ya meetse. Lekola le Kgoro ya Meetse le Kgwerano pele o katološa go nošetša.", "Ku teka mati exihlovweni, enambyeni kumbe edambyeni ku cheleta swi nga pfumeleriwa ehansi ka Xedulu 1 kumbe Mpfumelelo wa Hinkwavo, kumbe swi nga lava layisense yo tirhisa mati. Kambela na Ndzawulo ya Mati na Vuhlayiseki bya Rihanyo u nga si ndlandlamuxa ku cheleta.", "Ukuthatha amanzi emthonjeni wamanzi, emfuleni noma edamini ukuze unisele kungavunyelwa ngaphansi kweShejuli 1 noma iMvume Ejwayelekile, noma kungadinga ilayisensi yokusebenzisa amanzi. Hlola noMnyango Wezamanzi Nokuthuthwa Kwendle ngaphambi kokwandisa ukunisela."],
  "Tax": ["Belasting", "Motšhelo", "Xibalo", "Intela"],
  "Tax compliance status PIN": ["Belastingnakomingstatus-PIN", "PIN ya boemo bja kobamelo ya motšhelo", "PIN ya xiyimo xa ku landzela milawu ya xibalo", "I-PIN yesimo sokuthobela intela"],
  "Tax number and tax compliance status": ["Belastingnommer en belastingnakomingstatus", "Nomoro ya motšhelo le boemo bja kobamelo ya motšhelo", "Nomboro ya xibalo na xiyimo xa ku landzela milawu ya xibalo", "Inombolo yentela nesimo sokuthobela intela"],
  "Tax registration is required for a tax clearance PIN, which tenders, grants and exporters ask for.": ["Belastingregistrasie is nodig vir 'n belastingklaring-PIN, waarvoor tenders, toelaes en uitvoerders vra.", "Ngwadišo ya motšhelo e a nyakega bakeng sa PIN ya tumelelo ya motšhelo, yeo e kgopelwago ke ditentara, dithušo le baromela ntle.", "Ku tsarisela xibalo swa laveka eka PIN ya mpfumelelo wa xibalo, leyi kombeliwaka hi tithendara, mimpfuno na vaxavisi va le handle.", "Ukubhalisela intela kuyadingeka ukuze uthole i-PIN yemvume yentela, ecelwa ngamathenda, uxhaso nabathekelisi."],
  "Temperature protocol": ["Temperatuurprotokol", "Tshepedišo ya thempereitšha", "Nawu wa thempureche", "Umgomo wezinga lokushisa"],
  "The Department of Agriculture (Plant Health) negotiates market access. Check that your product may enter the destination market and which protocol (pest programme, treatments, registrations) applies.": ["Die Departement van Landbou (Plantgesondheid) onderhandel oor marktoegang. Gaan na of jou produk die bestemmingsmark mag binnegaan en watter protokol (plaagprogram, behandelings, registrasies) van toepassing is.", "Kgoro ya Temo (Maphelo a Dimela) e rerišana ka phihlelelo ya mmaraka. Lekola gore setšweletšwa sa gago se ka tsena mmarakeng wo o yago go wona le gore ke tshepedišo efe (lenaneo la dikokonyana, kalafo, dingwadišo) ye e šomago.", "Ndzawulo ya Vurimi (Rihanyo ra Swimila) yi burisana hi ku fikelela makete. Kambela leswaku xibuweriwa xa wena xi nga nghena eka makete lowu xi yaka eka wona na leswaku i nawu wihi (nongonoko wa swiphiqo, ku tshungula, ku tsarisa) lowu tirhaka.", "UMnyango wezoLimo (Impilo Yezitshalo) uxoxisana ngokufinyelela emakethe. Hlola ukuthi umkhiqizo wakho ungangena yini emakethe oya kuyo nokuthi yimuphi umgomo (uhlelo lwezinambuzane, ukwelashwa, ukubhalisa) osebenzayo."],
  "The EU sets specific phytosanitary conditions for citrus from South Africa, including measures for false codling moth and citrus black spot. Confirm the current conditions and which orchards and packhouses must be registered for the EU programme.": ["Die EU stel spesifieke fitosanitêre voorwaardes vir sitrus uit Suid-Afrika, insluitend maatreëls vir valskodlingmot en sitrus-swartvlek. Bevestig die huidige voorwaardes en watter boorde en pakhuise vir die EU-program geregistreer moet word.", "EU e bea maemo a itšego a maphelo a dimela bakeng sa dinamune tša Afrika Borwa, go akaretšwa magato a false codling moth le citrus black spot. Netefatša maemo a bjale le gore ke dirapa le dintlo tša go phuthela dife tše di swanetšego go ngwadišwa bakeng sa lenaneo la EU.", "EU yi veka swiyimo swo karhi swa rihanyo ra swimila swa malamula ku suka eAfrika-Dzonga, ku katsa magoza ya false codling moth na citrus black spot. Tiyisisa swiyimo swa sweswi na leswaku i mintanga na tiyindlu to paka tihi leti faneleke ku tsarisiwa eka nongonoko wa EU.", "I-EU ibeka imibandela ethile yempilo yezitshalo yamawolintshi aseNingizimu Afrika, kuhlanganise nezinyathelo ze-false codling moth ne-citrus black spot. Qinisekisa imibandela yamanje nokuthi yiziphi izivande nezindlu zokupakisha okufanele zibhaliselwe uhlelo lwe-EU."],
  "The HS (tariff) code shown for your product decides duties and paperwork. Confirm it with your clearing agent before you quote a buyer.": ["Die HS- (tarief)kode wat vir jou produk gewys word, bepaal regte en papierwerk. Bevestig dit by jou klaringsagent voordat jy 'n koper 'n kwotasie gee.", "Khoutu ya HS (ya tefelo) ye e bontšhwago bakeng sa setšweletšwa sa gago e laola ditefelo le dipampiri. E netefatše le moemedi wa gago wa go phatlalatša pele o fa moreki theko.", "Khodi ya HS (ya hakelo) leyi kombisiweke eka xibuweriwa xa wena yi boha tihakelo na maphepha. Yi tiyisise na muyimeri wa wena wo basisa u nga si nyika muxavi nxavo.", "Ikhodi ye-HS (yentela) ekhonjiswe umkhiqizo wakho inquma intela namaphepha. Yiqinisekise nomenzeli wakho wokukhipha ngaphambi kokunika umthengi intengo."],
  "The phytosanitary certificate is issued for the consignment once inspection requirements are met.": ["Die fitosanitêre sertifikaat word vir die besending uitgereik sodra die inspeksievereistes nagekom is.", "Setifikeiti sa maphelo a dimela se ntšhwa bakeng sa thoto ge dinyakego tša tlhahlobo di fihleletšwe.", "Xitifikheti xa rihanyo ra swimila xi humesiwa eka nhundzu loko swilaveko swa nkambelo swi fikeleriwile.", "Isitifiketi sempilo yezitshalo sikhishelwa impahla uma izidingo zokuhlola sezifinyelelwe."],
  "The structure decides your personal risk, how you are taxed and which funding you can apply for.": ["Die struktuur bepaal jou persoonlike risiko, hoe jy belas word en vir watter befondsing jy kan aansoek doen.", "Sebopego se laola kotsi ya gago, ka moo o lefišwago motšhelo ka gona le thušo ya ditšhelete yeo o ka e kgopelago.", "Xivumbeko xi boha khombo ra wena, ndlela leyi u hakelisiwaka xibalo ha yona na mpfuno wa timali lowu u nga wu kombelaka.", "Isakhiwo sinquma ubungozi bakho, indlela otheleswa ngayo kanye noxhaso ongalufakela isicelo."],
  "To claim the lower duty under the SACUM-UK EPA, issue the required proof of origin.": ["Om die laer reg onder die SACUM-VK EVO te eis, reik die vereiste bewys van oorsprong uit.", "Go kleima tefelo ya fase ka fase ga SACUM-UK EPA, ntšha bohlatse bjo bo nyakegago bja mathomo.", "Ku kombela hakelo ya le hansi ehansi ka SACUM-UK EPA, humesa vumbhoni lebyi lavekaka bya laha swi humaka kona.", "Ukuze ufune intela ephansi ngaphansi kwe-SACUM-UK EPA, khipha ubufakazi bemvelaphi obudingekayo."],
  "To claim the lower duty under the SADC-EU EPA, issue the required proof of origin (for example a EUR.1 movement certificate or origin declaration).": ["Om die laer reg onder die SAOG-EU EVO te eis, reik die vereiste bewys van oorsprong uit (byvoorbeeld 'n EUR.1-bewegingsertifikaat of oorsprongverklaring).", "Go kleima tefelo ya fase ka fase ga SADC-EU EPA, ntšha bohlatse bjo bo nyakegago bja mathomo (mohlala setifikeiti sa EUR.1 goba pego ya mathomo).", "Ku kombela hakelo ya le hansi ehansi ka SADC-EU EPA, humesa vumbhoni lebyi lavekaka bya laha swi humaka kona (xikombiso xitifikheti xa EUR.1 kumbe xiviko xa masungulo).", "Ukuze ufune intela ephansi ngaphansi kwe-SADC-EU EPA, khipha ubufakazi bemvelaphi obudingekayo (isibonelo isitifiketi se-EUR.1 noma isimemezelo semvelaphi)."],
  "Trading above the threshold without registering leads to backdated VAT, penalties and interest.": ["Om bo die drempel handel te dryf sonder om te registreer lei tot teruggedateerde BTW, boetes en rente.", "Go gweba godimo ga mellwane ntle le go ngwadiša go lebiša go VAT ya morago, dikotlo le tswala.", "Ku xavisa ehenhla ka mpimo handle ko tsarisa swi yisa eka VAT ya khale, magandzelo na nzalo.", "Ukuhweba ngaphezu komkhawulo ngaphandle kokubhalisa kuholela ku-VAT yesikhathi esedlule, izinhlawulo nenzalo."],
  "UK retailers generally require GLOBALG.A.P. (or an equivalent) certification and often their own retailer standard on top.": ["Britse kleinhandelaars vereis gewoonlik GLOBALG.A.P.- (of gelykwaardige) sertifisering en dikwels hul eie kleinhandelstandaard daarby.", "Barekiši ba UK gantši ba nyaka setifikeiti sa GLOBALG.A.P. (goba se se lekanago) gomme gantši le maemo a bona a barekiši godimo ga moo.", "Vaxavisi va UK hi ntolovelo va lava xitifikheti xa GLOBALG.A.P. (kumbe lexi ringanaka) naswona nkarhi wo tala na xiyimo xa vona xa vaxavisi ehenhla ka sweswo.", "Abathengisi base-UK bavame ukudinga isitifiketi se-GLOBALG.A.P. (noma esilinganayo) futhi kaningi nezinga labo lomthengisi phezu kwalokho."],
  "Unapproved structures can be fined or ordered demolished.": ["Ongoedgekeurde strukture kan beboet of gelas word om gesloop te word.", "Dibopego tše di sa dumelelwago di ka lefišwa kotlo goba tša laelwa go phušolwa.", "Swakiwa leswi nga pfumeleriwangiki swi nga gandzeriwa kumbe ku leriwa ku hahluriwa.", "Izakhiwo ezingavunyelwe zingahlawuliswa noma kuyalelwe ukuthi zidilizwe."],
  "Understand provisional tax": ["Verstaan voorlopige belasting", "Kwešiša motšhelo wa nakwana", "Twisisa xibalo xa nkarhinyana", "Qonda intela yesikhashana"],
  "United Kingdom": ["Verenigde Koninkryk", "United Kingdom", "United Kingdom", "I-United Kingdom"],
  "Unlawful water use can lead to fines and an order to stop irrigating.": ["Onwettige watergebruik kan lei tot boetes en 'n bevel om besproeiing te staak.", "Tšhomišo ya meetse ye e sego ya molao e ka lebiša go dikotlo le taelo ya go emiša go nošetša.", "Matirhiselo ya mati lama nga riki ya nawu ma nga yisa eka magandzelo na xileriso xo yimisa ku cheleta.", "Ukusebenzisa amanzi ngokungemthetho kungaholela ezinhlawulweni nomyalelo wokuyeka ukunisela."],
  "Upload bank statements every month": ["Laai bankstate elke maand op", "Romela ditatemente tša panka kgwedi le kgwedi", "Rhumela swiviko swa banka n'hweti na n'hweti", "Layisha izitatimende zasebhange nyanga zonke"],
  "Upload the bill of lading or waybill, invoice, packing list, inspection report and phytosanitary certificate to the vault for your records and future shipments.": ["Laai die vragbrief of vervoerbrief, faktuur, paklys, inspeksieverslag en fitosanitêre sertifikaat na die kluis op vir jou rekords en toekomstige besendings.", "Romela lengwalo la dithoto (bill of lading goba waybill), invoice, lenaneo la go phuthela, pego ya tlhahlobo le setifikeiti sa maphelo a dimela polokelong bakeng sa direkhoto tša gago le dithoto tše di tlago.", "Rhumela papila ra nhundzu (bill of lading kumbe waybill), invoyisi, nxaxamelo wo paka, xiviko xa nkambelo na xitifikheti xa rihanyo ra swimila eka vuhlayiselo eka tirekhodo ta wena na nhundzu leyi taka.", "Layisha i-bill of lading noma i-waybill, i-invoyisi, uhlu lokupakisha, umbiko wokuhlola nesitifiketi sempilo yezitshalo endaweni ephephile ukuze kube amarekhodi akho nezimpahla ezizayo."],
  "Upload the final shipping documents": ["Laai die finale verskepingsdokumente op", "Romela ditokumente tša mafelelo tša go romela", "Rhumela matsalwa yo hetelela ya ku rhumela", "Layisha imibhalo yokugcina yokuthumela"],
  "Upload your monthly statement (CSV or the bank's PDF) to Expense Analysis. It categorises spending and calculates cost per crop for your budget.": ["Laai jou maandelikse staat (CSV of die bank se PDF) na Uitgawe-ontleding op. Dit kategoriseer besteding en bereken koste per gewas vir jou begroting.", "Romela setatemente sa gago sa kgwedi (CSV goba PDF ya panka) go Tshekatsheko ya Ditshenyegelo. E hlopha tšhomišo ya tšhelete gomme e bala tshenyegelo ka sebjalo bakeng sa tekanyetšo ya gago.", "Rhumela xitatimende xa wena xa n'hweti (CSV kumbe PDF ya banka) eka Nxopaxopo wa Swihlawulo. Xi hlela matirhiselo ya mali naswona xi hlayela xihlawulo hi ximila eka bajete ya wena.", "Layisha isitatimende sakho senyanga (i-CSV noma i-PDF yebhange) ku-Ukuhlaziywa Kwezindleko. Ihlela ukusetshenziswa kwemali futhi ibale izindleko ngesitshalo zesabelomali sakho."],
  "Use a registered packhouse (PHC)": ["Gebruik 'n geregistreerde pakhuis (PHC)", "Šomiša ntlo ya go phuthela ye e ngwadišitšwego (PHC)", "Tirhisa yindlu yo paka leyi tsarisiweke (PHC)", "Sebenzisa indlu yokupakisha ebhalisiwe (PHC)"],
  "Use registered agricultural remedies and keep spray records": ["Gebruik geregistreerde landboumiddels en hou spuitrekords", "Šomiša dihlare tša temo tše di ngwadišitšwego gomme o boloke direkhoto tša go fafatša", "Tirhisa mirhi ya vurimi leyi tsarisiweke kutani u hlayisa tirekhodo to fafazela", "Sebenzisa amakhambi ezolimo abhalisiwe futhi ugcine amarekhodi okufafaza"],
  "Use the certificate of origin for the agreement that gives the best rate, so the buyer can claim preferential duty.": ["Gebruik die sertifikaat van oorsprong vir die ooreenkoms wat die beste koers gee, sodat die koper voorkeurreg kan eis.", "Šomiša setifikeiti sa mathomo sa tumelelano ye e fago seroto se sebotse, gore moreki a kgone go kleima tefelo ya tlhompho.", "Tirhisa xitifikheti xa masungulo xa xivumelwano lexi nyikaka mpimo lowunene, leswaku muxavi a kombela hakelo yo hlawuleka.", "Sebenzisa isitifiketi semvelaphi sesivumelwano esinikeza izinga elingcono, ukuze umthengi afune intela ekhethekile."],
  "VAT-registered primary producers can claim a refund on diesel used in farming activities. You need logbooks showing how the diesel was used.": ["BTW-geregistreerde primêre produsente kan 'n terugbetaling eis op diesel wat in boerdery-aktiwiteite gebruik is. Jy het logboeke nodig wat wys hoe die diesel gebruik is.", "Batšweletši ba motheo bao ba ngwadišitšwego go VAT ba ka kleima go bušetšwa tšhelete ya disele ye e šomišitšwego ditirong tša temo. O nyaka dipuku tša go ngwala tšeo di bontšhago ka moo disele e šomišitšwego ka gona.", "Vahumelerisi va masungulo lava tsarisiweke eka VAT va nga kombela ku vuyiseriwa mali ya dizele leyi tirhisiweke eka mintirho ya vurimi. U lava tibuku to tsala leti kombaka ndlela leyi dizele yi tirhisiweke ha yona.", "Abakhiqizi abayinhloko ababhaliswe ku-VAT bangafuna ukubuyiselwa kwemali kadizili osetshenziswe emisebenzini yezolimo. Udinga izincwadi zokubhala ezikhombisa ukuthi udizili usetshenziswe kanjani."],
  "Vegetables": ["Groente", "Merogo", "Matsavu", "Imifino"],
  "Workers are entitled to UIF benefits; employers must contribute and declare.": ["Werkers is geregtig op UIF-voordele; werkgewers moet bydra en verklaar.", "Bašomi ba swanelwa ke dikholego tša UIF; bathwadi ba swanetše go ntšha seabelo le go tsebiša.", "Vatirhi va fanelekela mimpfuno ya UIF; vathori va fanele ku hakela xiave na ku tivisa.", "Abasebenzi banelungelo lezinzuzo ze-UIF; abaqashi kufanele banikele futhi bamemezele."],
  "Your budget and cash-flow forecast use these actual costs.": ["Jou begroting en kontantvloeivoorspelling gebruik hierdie werklike koste.", "Tekanyetšo ya gago le kakanyo ya phallo ya tšhelete di šomiša ditshenyegelo tše tša nnete.", "Bajete ya wena na vuprofeta bya ku khuluka ka mali swi tirhisa swihlawulo leswi swa xiviri.", "Isabelomali sakho nesibikezelo sokugeleza kwemali kusebenzisa lezi zindleko zangempela."],
  "Your clearing agent submits the export declaration to SARS Customs using your customs code, commercial invoice and packing list.": ["Jou klaringsagent dien die uitvoerverklaring by SARS Doeane in met jou doeanekode, handelsfaktuur en paklys.", "Moemedi wa gago wa go phatlalatša o romela pego ya go romela ntle go SARS Customs ka khoutu ya gago ya customs, invoice ya kgwebo le lenaneo la go phuthela.", "Muyimeri wa wena wo basisa u rhumela xiviko xo xavisa ehandle eka SARS Customs hi khodi ya wena ya customs, invoyisi ya bindzu na nxaxamelo wo paka.", "Umenzeli wakho wokukhipha uthumela isimemezelo sokuthekelisa ku-SARS Customs esebenzisa ikhodi yakho yamakhastomu, i-invoyisi yezohwebo nohlu lokupakisha."],
  "Your EU importer must pre-notify the consignment in the EU's official system before it arrives. Send them the details early.": ["Jou EU-invoerder moet die besending vooraf in die EU se amptelike stelsel aanmeld voordat dit aankom. Stuur vir hulle die besonderhede vroeg.", "Motsenya wa gago wa EU o swanetše go tsebiša ka thoto pele tshepedišong ya semmušo ya EU pele e fihla. Mo romele dintlha ka pela.", "Munghenisi wa wena wa EU u fanele ku tivisa hi nhundzu ka ha ri emahlweni eka sisiteme ya ximfumo ya EU yi nga si fika. N'wi rhumele vuxokoxoko ka ha ri emahlweni.", "Umngenisi wakho we-EU kufanele aziswe kusengaphambili ngempahla ohlelweni olusemthethweni lwe-EU ngaphambi kokuthi ifike. Mthumele imininingwane kusenesikhathi."],
  "Your turnover band is at or above the compulsory VAT registration threshold. Register with SARS and start charging and claiming VAT. Check the current threshold on the SARS website.": ["Jou omsetband is op of bo die verpligte BTW-registrasiedrempel. Registreer by SARS en begin BTW hef en eis. Kontroleer die huidige drempel op die SARS-webwerf.", "Sehlopha sa gago sa letseno se lekana goba se feta mellwane ya ngwadišo ye e gapeletšwago ya VAT. Ngwadiša go SARS o thome go lefiša le go kleima VAT. Lekola mellwane ya bjale go saete ya SARS.", "Ntlawa wa wena wa mali leyi nghenaka wu ringana kumbe wu tlula mpimo wa ku tsarisela VAT hi ku boheka. Tsarisa eka SARS u sungula ku hakelisa na ku kombela VAT. Kambela mpimo wa sweswi eka websayiti ya SARS.", "Ibhendi yakho yemali yokuthengisa ilingana noma ingaphezu komkhawulo wokubhalisela i-VAT ngokuphoqelekile. Bhalisa ku-SARS bese uqala ukukhokhisa nokufuna i-VAT. Hlola umkhawulo wamanje kuwebhusayithi ye-SARS."],
};
